27bccda5e63.jpeg',52,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>The Thermalright Odyssey 0.5mm thermal pad has a <mark>thermal conductivity of 12.8 W/mK</mark>, dimensions of 85x45x0.5mm, and is non-conductive.</p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div>\r\n<p>Detailed Specifications:</p><ul><li><strong>Thermal Conductivity:</strong> 12.8 W/mK</li><li><strong>Color:</strong> Gray</li><li><strong>Density:</strong> 3.1±0.2 g/cc</li><li><strong>Hardness:</strong> 30~55 Sc</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 85x45 mm</li><li><strong>Breakdown Voltage:</strong> 9.8 KV</li><li><strong>Electrical Conductivity:</strong> None (Non-conductive)</li><li><strong>Thickness:</strong> 0.5 mm <div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></div></li></ul></div>\r\n<p>Additional Notes:</p><ul><li>These thermal pads are designed to be easily cut and shaped to fit various heat sinks and devices. <div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></div></li>\r\n<li>They are intended to improve thermal transfer between components, helping to dissipate heat and prevent overheating. \r\n<div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></li><li>The pads are suitable for use on CPUs, GPUs, SSDs, VRAM, and other components.</li></ul></div>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'thermalright-odyssey-05mm-thermal-pad',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,33,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(60,'THER004','THERMALRIGHT ODYSSEY 1.0MM THERMAL PAD',1,1000.0000,2500.0000,0.0000,'f0e43a2f927da8e2557ef58df2fff578.jpeg',52,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>The Thermalright Odyssey 1.0mm thermal pad has a <mark>thermal conductivity of 12.8 W/mK, is gray in color, and has a density of 3.1±0.2 g/cc and a hardness of 30~55 Sc</mark>. It is available in multiple sizes, including 85x45mm and 120x120mm. The pad is electrically non-conductive and has a breakdown voltage of 9.8KV.</p><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div>\r\n<div><div>Here\\\'s a more detailed breakdown: \r\n<div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Thermal Conductivity:</strong> 12.8 W/mK.</li><li><strong>Color:</strong> Gray.</li><li><strong>Density:</strong> 3.1±0.2 g/cc.</li><li><strong>Hardness:</strong> 30~55 Sc.</li><li><strong>Sizes:</strong> 85x45mm and 120x120mm.</li><li><strong>Thickness:</strong> 1.0 mm.</li><li><strong>Electrical Conductivity:</strong> Non-conductive.</li><li><strong>Breakdown Voltage:</strong> 9.8 KV.</li><li><strong>Harmless:</strong> Yes.</li></ul></div></div>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'thermalright-odyssey-10mm-thermal-pad',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,28,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(61,'THER003','THERMALRIGHT ODYSSEY 1.5MM THERMAL PAD',1,1000.0000,2800.0000,0.0000,'7480824f7eecce49f0ae741558d6b9ec.jpeg',52,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>The Thermalright Odyssey 1.5mm thermal pad has a <mark>thermal conductivity of 12.8 W/m-k</mark> and is non-conductive, making it safe for use with electrical components. It is available in various sizes, including 120x120mm and 85x45mm.</p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div>\r\n<p>Detailed Specifications:</p><ul><li><strong>Thermal Conductivity:</strong> 12.8 W/m-k</li><li><strong>Color:</strong> Gray</li><li><strong>Density:</strong> 3.1 ± 0.2 g/cc</li><li><strong>Hardness:</strong> 30~55 Sc</li><li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> Available in 120x120mm and 85x45mm</li><li><strong>Thickness:</strong> 1.5mm</li><li><strong>Breakdown Voltage:</strong> 9.8 KV</li><li><strong>Electrically Conductive:</strong> NO</li><li><strong>Harmless:</strong> YES <div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></div></li></ul></div>\r\n<p>Additional Notes:</p><ul><li>The pads can be cut to fit various sizes and shapes. <div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></div></li>\r\n<li>They are suitable for a wide range of applications, including CPU, GPU, and SSD cooling. \r\n<div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></li><li>The 1.5mm thickness is designed to fill the gaps between heat sinks and components.</li></ul></div>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'thermalright-odyssey-15mm-thermal-pad',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,22,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(62,'THER002','THERMALRIGHT ODYSSEY 2.0MM THERMAL PAD',1,1000.0000,3000.0000,0.0000,'10ce34c7be2c58225df9b7d0b8ebfbdf.jpeg',52,NULL,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>The Thermalright Odyssey 2.0mm thermal pad is designed for heat dissipation and features a <mark>thermal conductivity of 12.8 W/mK</mark>. It is made of a gray silica gel material and has a density of 3.1±0.2 g/cc. The pad is non-conductive and has a breakdown voltage of 9.8KV. It is available in various sizes, including 85x45mm and 120x120mm. </p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div>\r\n<p>Here\\\'s a more detailed breakdown of the specifications:</p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div>\r\n<p>Key Features:</p><ul><li><strong>Thermal Conductivity:</strong> 12.8 W/mK.</li><li><strong>Material:</strong> Gray silica gel.</li><li><strong>Density:</strong> 3.1±0.2 g/cc.</li><li><strong>Thickness:</strong> 2.0mm.</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 85x45mm and 120x120mm (or other sizes depending on the specific model).</li><li><strong>Electrical Conductivity:</strong> None (non-conductive).</li><li><strong>Breakdown Voltage:</strong> 9.8KV.</li><li><strong>Hardness:</strong> 30~55 Sc.</li><li><strong>Color:</strong> Gray. <div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></div></li></ul></div>\r\n<p>Other Information:</p><ul><li>The pad is designed to improve heat transfer between electronic components. <div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></div></li>\r\n<li>It is suitable for use in various applications, including CPUs, GPUs, and other electronic devices. \r\n<div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></li>\r\n<li>The pad can be cut to fit specific needs. \r\n<div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></li><li>It is safe to use and does not interfere with electrical components.</li></ul></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'thermalright-odyssey-20mm-thermal-pad',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,16,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(63,'LAP019','ASUS VIVOBOOK F1502Z | I5 12TH GEN 12500H | 16GB | 512GB | 15.6INCH LAPTOP',1,168000.0000,183000.0000,0.0000,'fb89e15681d5002f962986c72d202d13.png',90,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>01 YEAR WARRANTY</p><ul><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12500H (12th Gen).</li><li><strong>RAM:</strong> 16GB DDR4.</li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe 3.0 SSD.</li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Xe Graphics.</li><li><strong>Display:</strong> 15.6-inch Full HD (1920 x 1080) IPS LED display.</li><li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Wi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) and Bluetooth 5.3.</li><li><strong>Ports:</strong> Includes USB Type-A, USB Type-C, HDMI, and a 3.5mm audio jack.</li><li><strong>Other features:</strong> Built-in webcam, microphone, and ASUS\\\'s MyASUS software suite.</li></ul>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,3,'asus-vivobook-f1502z-i5-12th-gen-12500h-16gb-512gb-lapt',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,67,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(66,'LAP017','ASUS VIVOBOOK M1605Y | R7 7730U | 8GB | 512GB NVME | 15.6INCH LAPTOP',1,176000.0000,198000.0000,0.0000,'b9411e997fc86b43664bc4fe840b85b0.png',90,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>01 YEAR HARWARE WARRANTY</p><p>Processor:</p><ul>\r\n<li>AMD Ryzen 7 7730U (13th Gen).</li><li>8 cores, 16 thread