22 grams</li><li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> Approximately 5.12 x 3.54 x 0.28 inches or 10 x 5 x 1 cm</li><li><strong>Safety Certifications:</strong> CE, FCC, RoHS certified</li><li><strong>Protection Features:</strong> Over voltage, short circuit, and over current protection</li></ul></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,5,'hp-pavilion-15-au-series-laptop-battery-bp02xl',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(119,'PHDD003','TRANSCEND STOREJET 25H3 2TB PORTABLE HDD',1,26500.0000,28500.0000,0.0000,'c5f4ed7c641368f01426d28a29d7c724.jpeg',65,NULL,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>03 YEARS WARRANTY</p><ul><li>The Transcend StoreJet 25H3 2TB portable HDD is a rugged, shock-resistant hard drive with a <mark>2TB capacity and USB 3.1 Gen 1 interface</mark>. It\\\'s designed for portability and data protection, offering features like One Touch Auto-backup and AES encryption through the Transcend Elite software. <div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><div><div>Key Features and Specifications:<br><ul><li><strong>Storage Capacity:</strong> 2TB</li><li><strong>Drive Type:</strong> 2.5\\\" HDD</li><li><strong>Interface:</strong> USB 3.1 Gen 1 (Micro-USB 3.0 / 3.1/3.2 Gen 1)</li><li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 131.8 mm x 80.8 mm x 24.5 mm (5.19\\\" x 3.18\\\" x 0.96\\\")</li><li><strong>Weight:</strong> 284g (10.01 oz)</li><li><strong>Operating Temperature:</strong> 5°C (41°F) to 55°C (131°F)</li><li><strong>Shock Resistance:</strong> Shock/Drop-Resistant</li><li><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> Water-Resistant (MIL-STD-810)</li><li><strong>Software:</strong> Transcend Elite (One Touch Auto-backup, AES encryption)</li><li><strong>Power:</strong> Bus-powered</li><li><strong>Operating Systems Supported:</strong> Universal Computer/Mobile OS Support</li></ul><br></div></div></div></div></div></li></ul>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,22,'transcend-storejet-25h3-2tb-portable-hdd',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,50,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(120,'THPST003','ARCTIC MX-4 THERMAL COMPOUND 4G',1,500.0000,1500.0000,0.0000,'8094f4b071d49c46fb7ed953f6a6b3fb.jpeg',51,NULL,'','','','','','',2.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>The ARCTIC MX-4 4g thermal compound is a high-performance paste designed for efficient heat dissipation. It features a <mark>thermal conductivity of 8.5 W/mK, a viscosity of 870 poise, and a density of 2.5 g/cm³</mark>.</p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><p>Key Specifications: </p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><ul><li><strong>Thermal Conductivity:</strong> 8.5 W/mK</li><li><strong>Viscosity:</strong> 870 poise</li><li><strong>Density:</strong> 2.5 g/cm³</li><li><strong>Volume Resistivity:</strong> 3.8 x 10¹³ Ω-cm</li><li><strong>Continuous Use Temperature:</strong> -50°C to 150°C</li><li><strong>Durability:</strong> 8 years</li><li><strong>Color:</strong> Grey</li></ul><p>Other Notable Features: </p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><ul><li>\r\n<div><strong>Easy Application:</strong><p>MX-4 is designed to be easy to apply, even for beginners, according to ARCTIC.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</li><li>\r\n<p><strong>Non-Conductive:</strong>\r\n</p><p>It does not contain metallic particles, making it electrically safe for use with computer components.</p></li><li>\r\n<p><strong>High Thermal Conductivity:</strong>\r\n</p><p>Its carbon micro-particles contribute to its high thermal conductivity, facilitating quick heat dissipation.</p></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'arctic-mx-4-thermal-compound-4g',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,83,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(121,'THPST002','ARCTIC MX-4 THERMAL COMPOUND WITH BOX',1,500.0000,2500.0000,0.0000,'e0d16de41b7c77b44fb90889ca0f8a5e.jpeg',51,NULL,'','','','','','',2.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>The ARCTIC MX-4 4g thermal compound is a high-performance paste designed for efficient heat dissipation. It features a <mark>thermal conductivity of 8.5 W/mK, a viscosity of 870 poise, and a density of 2.5 g/cm³</mark>. </p><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;<p>Key Specifications: </p>\r\n<div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;<ul><li><strong>Thermal Conductivity:</strong> 8.5 W/mK</li><li><strong>Viscosity:</strong> 870 poise</li><li><strong>Density:</strong> 2.5 g/cm³</li><li><strong>Volume Resistivity:</strong> 3.8 x 10¹³ Ω-cm</li><li><strong>Continuous Use Temperature:</strong> -50°C to 150°C</li><li><strong>Durability:</strong> 8 years</li><li><strong>Color:</strong> Grey</li></ul><p>Other Notable Features: </p>\r\n<div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;<ul><li>\r\n<p><strong>Easy Application:</strong></p><p>MX-4 is designed to be easy to apply, even for beginners, according to ARCTIC.</p>\r\n\r\n</li><li>\r\n<p><strong>Non-Conductive:</strong>\r\n</p><p>It does not contain metallic particles, making it electrically safe for use with computer components.</p></li><li>\r\n<p><strong>High Thermal Conductivity:</strong>\r\n</p><p>Its carbon micro-particles contribute to its high thermal conductivity, facilitating quick heat dissipation.</p></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'arctic-mx-4-thermal-compound-with-box',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,7,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(122,'MOU005','LOGITECH B100 MOUSE',1,1000.0000,2000.0000,0.0000,'7d48a8c28a0068f2e63dc8dc984d505b.jpeg',77,NULL,'','','','','','',4.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>02 YEAR WARRANTY</p><p>Comfortable ambidextrous shape</p><p>Precision 800 dpi sensor</p><p>Vertical and horizontal scrolling plus zoom</p><p>Plug-and-play USB cord connection</p><p>Quality design by Logitech, the mouse experts</p><p>Works with Windows, Mac and Linux operating systems</p><p>Logitech B100 Wired USB Optical Mouse</p><p>An office essential from the mouse experts</p><p>Get more done. And feel better doing it. B100 brings you Logitech design quality in a sculpted, ambidextrous shape that feels good in either hand. So you feel more comfortable as you work—even at the end of the day. With 800 dpi sensitivity, you’ll get precise cursor control to edit documents and navigate the Web more efficiently.</p><p>Comfortable shape for either hand</p><p>Right handed? Left handed? Either way, the contoured shape supports your hand in all-day comfort. And the mouse buttons and scroll wheel put comfortable control right at your fingertips.</p><p>Precise cursor control</p><p>With an 800 dpi optical sensor, you’ve got the cursor control you need to quickly and accurately point, highlight, cut and paste.</p><p>Versatile scrolling plus zoom</p><p>Side-to-side scrolling plus zoom lets you instantly zoom in or out and scroll horizontally and vertically. Perfect for working with spreadsheets and presentations.</p><p>Zero setup</p><p>Works right out of the box — just plug it into your USB port and you’re ready for business.</p><p>Built-in Logitech quality</p><p>B100 comes with the quality and design Logitech has built into more than a billion mice, more than any other manufacturer.</p>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,75,'logitech-b100-mouse',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(124,'MOU003','LOGITECH M90 MOUSE',1,1000.0000,1900.0000,0.0000,'2b40f25d7428262ff9cb46eb6c7ae8a0.jpeg',77,NULL,'','','','','','',5.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p>\r\n<div><div>The Logitech M90 mouse is a basic, wired, optical mouse with a <mark>1000 DPI resolution, ambidextrous design, and a simple plug-and-play USB connection</mark>. It features a sleek black design and is compatible with various operating systems, including Windows, macOS, and Linux. \r\n<div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><p>Key Features:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>DPI:</strong> 1000 DPI</li><li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Wired, USB</li><li><strong>Design:</strong> Ambidextrous</li><li><strong>Operating Systems:</strong> Windows, macOS, Linux</li><li><strong>No Software:</strong> Plug-and-play, no software installation required</li><li><strong>Cable Length:</strong> 1.8 meters</li><li><strong>Weight:</strong> 0.090 kg</li><li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 40 x 90 x 130 mm</li><li><strong>Buttons:</strong> 3</li></ul></div></div>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,75,'logitech-m90-mouse',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(126,'LAPFAN011','HP 15S-DU LAPTOP FAN',1,2750.0000,6000.0000,0.0000,'7a9720f7ff01bc2cad93d9bed9428770.jpeg',88,81,'','','','','','',1.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'',NULL,'standard',16,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'hp-15s-du-laptop-fan',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,1,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(127,'LAPFAN010','ASUS VIVOBOOK X509 X409U X509F X509U X409F LAPTOP FAN',1,2750.0000,5500.0000,0.0000,'73106d73bee52ca550f768d94e232a48.jpeg',81,NULL,'','','','','','',2.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'',NULL,'standard',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'asus-vivobook-x509-x409u-x509f-x509u-x409f-laptop-fan',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,12,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(128,'LAPFAN009','DELL 3590 | 3593 | 3580 LAPTOP FAN',1,3000.0000,5500.0000,0.0000,'8b1303081bac310954891a034588e0d2.jpeg',81,NULL,'','','','','','',2.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,4,'dell-3590-3593-3580-laptop-fan',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,