G5-5DK56PA, 745 G6 R7-3700U, 755 G5-3PK93AW Series</li><li>HP ZBook 14U G5/G6 Mobile Workstation Series</li><li>HP mt44 Mobile Thin Client Series</li><li>HP EliteBook 840 G6 Healthcare Edition</li><li>HP EliteBook 846 G5/G6 Healthcare Edition Series</li></ul></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,5,'hp-elitebook-730-735-740-745-755-830-840-846-g5-laptop-',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,10,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(144,'LPBT022','TOSHIBA PA3817U LAPTOP BATTERY',1,4500.0000,7000.0000,0.0000,'no_image.png',88,85,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The Toshiba PA3817U battery (often PA3817U-1BRS) is a 6-cell Li-ion battery for older Satellite laptops, typically operating at 10.8V or 11.1V, with capacities around 5200mAh / 56Wh (or slightly less at 48Wh/49Wh for some variations). It provides reliable power, often matching or exceeding original specs, and is compatible with many Toshiba Satellite models like the C650, C660, L600, L700, L750, and P755 series. </p><p>Key Specifications:</p><p>Model: PA3817U, PA3817U-1BRS</p><p>Type: Lithium-ion (Li-ion)</p><p>Cells: 6</p><p>Voltage: 10.8V or 11.1V</p><p>Capacity: ~5200mAh / 56Wh (can vary slightly, e.g., 48Wh, 49Wh)</p><p>Color: Black</p><p>Compatibility: Toshiba Satellite C650, C660, L600, L700, L750, L755, P755, and many others in those series. </p>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,52,'toshiba-pa3817u-laptop-battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(146,'ULAP004','USED HP PROBOOK 645 G4 RYZEN 7 PRO 2700U | 16GB | 256GB | 14INCH | BACKLIT LAPTOP',1,66500.0000,86500.0000,0.0000,'e93fcd221dfb378e4d7da7bfaa6d6c6b.jpeg',89,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The HP ProBook 645 G4 with Ryzen 7 Pro 2700U has a 14-inch HD display (1366