rts (USB-C), 3.5mm headphone jack, 802.11ac Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth 4.2.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',19,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'used-macbook-pro-a1707-2017-i7-16gb-ram-512gb-touch-bar',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,6,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(159,'10158','USED MACBOOK PRO A2159 (2017)',1,105000.0000,135000.0000,0.0000,'no_image.png',46,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,1,1,'',NULL,'',NULL,'',0,'standard',NULL,0.0000,NULL,0.0000,NULL,0.0000,NULL,0.0000,NULL,0.0000,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','','','','',1,1,NULL,'used-macbook-pro-a2159-2017',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'',0,NULL,NULL),(160,'ERBD001','AIR PODS PRO',1,3000.0000,4800.0000,0.0000,'dcb0b724fa92f505cac8834019df2d6f.jpeg',48,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'',NULL,'standard',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'air-pods-pro',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,9,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(161,'RAM011','CORSAIR VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 SO-DIMM 5200MHZ LAPTOP MEMORY',1,17500.0000,19000.0000,0.0000,'41698f323ac603f7290bf1a5223740fc.jpeg',62,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>03 YEARS WARRANTY</p><p>The CORSAIR VENGEANCE 16GB DDR5 SO-DIMM 5200MHz laptop memory has <mark>a capacity of 16GB, operates at 5200MHz, utilizes DDR5 technology, and is designed for use in laptops</mark>. It features an aluminum heat spreader, black memory color, and is compatible with Intel 600 and 700 Series platforms. The memory also supports Intel XMP 3.0 for performance optimization. </p><div><br><div><div><p>Key Features:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 16GB</li><li><strong>Memory Type:</strong> DDR5 SO-DIMM</li><li><strong>Speed:</strong> 5200MHz</li><li><strong>Package Memory Format:</strong> DIMM</li><li><strong>Pin Count:</strong> 288</li><li><strong>Heat Spreader:</strong> Aluminum</li><li><strong>Color:</strong> Black</li><li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Intel 600 Series and 700 Series platforms</li><li><strong>Performance Profile:</strong> Intel XMP 3.0</li><li><strong>Tested Speed:</strong> 5200 MT/s</li><li><strong>Tested Latency:</strong> 40-40-40-77</li><li><strong>Tested Voltage:</strong> 1.25V</li><li><strong>SPD Speed:</strong> 4800MHz</li><li><strong>SPD Latency:</strong> 40-40-40-77</li><li><strong>SPD Voltage:</strong> 1.1V</li></ul></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,17,'corsair-vengeance-16gb-ddr5-so-dimm-5200mhz-laptop-memo',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,11,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(162,'RAM012','ADATA DDR5 32GB 4800MHZ VALUE LAPTOP RAM',1,23000.0000,28000.0000,0.0000,'e8144df0d40d425012ca27814206b2d7.jpeg',62,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>03 YEARS WARRANTY</p><p>The ADATA DDR5 32GB 4800MHz value laptop RAM offers a significant performance boost and energy efficiency compared to DDR4, with features like <mark>on-die ECC and a built-in power management IC</mark>. It\\\'s designed for modern laptops and supports faster speeds, higher capacities, and improved stability. </p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div>\r\n<p>Key Specifications:</p><ul><li><strong>Type:</strong> DDR5 SO-DIMM</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 32GB</li><li><strong>Speed:</strong> 4800 MT/s (Megatransfers per second)</li><li><strong>Operating Voltage:</strong> 1.1V</li><li><strong>Features:</strong><ul><li><strong>On-Die ECC:</strong> Reduces memory errors for improved data integrity.</li><li><strong>Built-in Power Management IC:</strong> Enhances power efficiency and stability.</li><li><strong>Higher Frequencies:</strong> Optimized for faster data processing.</li><li><strong>Higher Capacities:</strong> Supports demanding applications and multitasking. <div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></div></li></ul></li></ul></div>\r\n<p>Benefits:</p><ul><li><strong>Performance:</strong> DDR5 provides significant speed and bandwidth improvements over DDR4. <div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></div></li>\r\n<li><strong>Energy Efficiency:</strong> DDR5 operates at lower voltages, leading to reduced power consumption. \r\n<div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></li>\r\n<li><strong>Stability:</strong> On-die ECC and power management features contribute to more stable operation. \r\n<div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 32GB is a good baseline for modern laptops, especially for tasks like gaming and multimedia creation.</li></ul></div>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,12,'adata-ddr5-32gb-4800mhz-value-laptop-ram',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,5,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(164,'RAM009','ADATA DDR5 8GB 5600MHZ LAPTOP RAM',1,8700.0000,34000.0000,0.0000,'084513bf508fd1cc14dc8b23e74cc051.jpeg',62,NULL,'','','','','','',2.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>03 YEARS WARRANTY</p><p>The ADATA DDR5 8GB 5600MHz laptop RAM is a SO-DIMM module designed for laptops and features <mark>a capacity of 8GB and a speed of 5600MHz</mark>. It operates at a low voltage of 1.1V and has a CAS latency of 46. The module is built with a built-in PMIC (Power Management IC) for stable power and on-die ECC (Error Correcting Code) for enhanced reliability. It is designed to work with the latest Intel and AMD platforms. </p><p>Here\\\'s a more detailed breakdown of the specifications: </p><ul><li><strong>Memory Type:</strong> DDR5</li><li><strong>Form Factor:</strong> SO-DIMM (Small Outline Dual In-Line Memory Module)</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 8GB</li><li><strong>Speed:</strong> 5600MHz</li><li><strong>CAS Latency:</strong> 46</li><li><strong>Operating Voltage:</strong> 1.1V</li><li><strong>Operating Temperature:</strong> 0°C to 85°C</li><li><strong>Key Features:</strong><ul><li>Higher speeds and capacities compared to DDR4</li><li>Built-in PMIC for stable power</li><li>On-die ECC for enhanced reliability</li><li>Compatible with the latest Intel and AMD platforms</li></ul></li></ul>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,12,'adata-ddr5-8gb-5600mhz-laptop-ram',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,8,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(165,'RAM005','ADATA DDR5 16GB 4800MHZ LAPTOP RAM',1,15000.0000,73500.0000,0.0000,'4159deeddbccf12f445f6b5ebbd7efed.jpeg',62,NULL,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>03 YEARS WARRANTY</p><ul><li><strong>Memory Type:</strong> DDR5</li><li><strong>Form Factor:</strong> SO-DIMM</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 16GB</li><li><strong>Speed:</strong> 4800 MT/s (Million Transfers per second)</li><li><strong>CAS Latency:</strong> CL40</li><li><strong>Operating Voltage:</strong> 1.1V</li><li><strong>Operating Temperature:</strong> 0°C to 85°C</li></ul>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,41,'adata-ddr5-16gb-4800mhz-laptop-ram',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,27,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(166,'RAM008','ADATA DDR5 4800MHZ 8GB LAPTOP RAM',1,8500.0000,33000.0000,0.0000,'fbe291d852cc7543d11cc15e7a099c8e.jpeg',62,NULL,'','','','','','',7.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>03 YEARS WARRANTY</p><p>The ADATA DDR5 4800MHz 8GB laptop RAM is a SO-DIMM module designed for laptops. It features a <mark>speed of 4800MT/s, an operating voltage of 1.1V, and CAS latencies of 40</mark>. This RAM module is designed for laptops and has a capacity of 8GB. </p><p>Key Features:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Memory Type:</strong> DDR5</li><li><strong>Speed:</strong> 4800MHz (4800 MT/s)</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 8GB</li><li><strong>Form Factor:</strong> SO-DIMM</li><li><strong>Voltage:</strong> 1.1V</li><li><strong>CAS Latency:</strong> 40</li><li><strong>Pin Count:</strong> 262 pins</li><li><strong>Operating Temperature:</strong> 0°C to 85°C</li></ul>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,12,'adata-ddr5-4800mhz-8gb-laptop-ram',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,3,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(168,'LPBT024','HP COMPAQ CQ42 CQ62 CQ72 G42 G56 LAPTOP BATTERY MU06 MU09',1,4000.0000,6500.0000,0.0000,'7c6e89be06e00734a723e74251a50118.jpeg',85,NULL,'','','','','','',3.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The MU06 and MU09 are both battery part numbers for HP Compaq and Pavilion laptops, specifically models like the CQ42, CQ62, CQ72, G42, and G56. These batteries are <mark>6-cell, Lithium-Ion, and typically have a voltage of 11.1V (compatible with 10.8V) and a capacity of 5200mAh</mark>. </p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><div>Here\\\'s a more detailed breakdown:\r\n<p>Key Specs:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Battery Type:</strong> 6-cell Lithium-Ion \r\n<div></div></li><li><strong>Voltage:</strong> 11.1V (also works with 10.8V) </li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 5200mAh (real capacity may be closer to 4400mAh) </li><li><strong>Compatible Models:</strong><ul><li>HP Compaq Presario CQ32, CQ42, CQ43, CQ56, CQ57, CQ62, CQ72 series </li><li>HP Pavilion G4, G6, G7, G32, G42, G56, G62, G72 series </li><li>HP Pavilion DM4, DV3, DV5, DV6, DV7 series </li></ul></li><li><strong>Compatible Part Numbers:</strong> MU06, MU09, 593553-001, 593554-001, 593550-001, 593562-001, 586006-321, 586006-361, 586007-541, 586028-341, 588178-141, HSTNN-YB0X, HSTNN-Q64C, and many more. </li></ul></div><p>Important Notes:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>While the label capacity is 5200mAh, the real capacity may be closer to 4400mAh. \r\n<div></div></li><li>10.8V and 11.1V batteries are commonly used in laptops. </li><li>These batteries are designed to be a replacement for the original battery in these laptop models. </li><li>It\\\'s always recommended to verify the compatibility of the battery with your specific laptop model before purchasing.</li></ul></div></div>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'','',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,5,'hp-compaq-cq42-cq62-cq72-g42-g56-laptop-battery-mu06-mu',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,3,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(169,'LPBT025','HP 15-BS000 15-BW000 17-BS000 LAPTOP BATTERY JC04 (ALL MOD SUPPORTED)',1,5000.0000,8000.0000,0.0000,'d14eeb1e953fdf06f9a2d3fa9b9b0843.jpeg',88,85,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The JC04 battery is a replacement for HP 15-BS000, 15-BW000, and 17-BS000 series laptops. It\\\'s a <mark>4-cell, 14.8V, 41.6Wh lithium-ion battery</mark>. It\\\'s also compatible with other HP models like the 14-BS, 14-BW, 240 G6, 245 G6, and 250 G6.</p><div><div>Key Features:<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Battery Type:</strong> Lithium-ion.</li><li><strong>Voltage:</strong> 14.8V.</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 41.6Wh.</li><li><strong>Number of Cells:</strong> 4-cell.</li><li><strong>Compatible Models:</strong> HP 15-BS000, 15-BW000, 17-BS000, 14-BS, 14-BW, 240 G6, 245 G6, 250 G6, and others.</li><li><strong>Compatible Part Numbers:</strong> JC04, HSTNN-DB8E, HSTNN-H7BX, 919682-241, 919701-850.</li></ul></div></div>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'hp-15-bs000-15-bw000-17-bs000-laptop-battery-jc04-all-m',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,1,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(171,'LPBT026','ASUS A41-X550 X550A X550B A450 P550 F550 LAPTOP BATTERY',1,4000.0000,7500.0000,0.0000,'3b9e28a72aece26b206edd46b6c86627.jpeg',88,85,'','','','','','',2.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The ASUS A41-X550 series laptop battery is a <mark>Li-ion battery with a capacity of 2950mAh/44Wh and a voltage of 15V</mark>. It is compatible with various ASUS laptop models including the X550, A450, P550, and F550 series. It is also known as the A41-X550A battery.</p><div><div><div><p>Key Specifications:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Battery Type:</strong> Li-ion</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 2950mAh / 44Wh</li><li><strong>Voltage:</strong> 15V</li><li><strong>Part Numbers:</strong> A41-X550A, A41-X550</li>\r\n<li><strong>Compatible Laptop Models:</strong> X550 Series (X550A, X550B, X550C, etc.), A450 Series (A450A, A450C, etc.), P550 Series, F550 Series, and potentially others. \r\n<div></div></li></ul></div><p>Important Notes:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The battery is designed to be a replacement for the original battery in the compatible ASUS laptop models. \r\n<div></div></li><li>It\\\'s crucial to ensure that you are purchasing a battery compatible with your specific laptop model to avoid compatibility issues. </li><li>Li-ion batteries are known for their good performance, safety, and relatively long lifespan compared to older battery technologies.</li></ul></div></div>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,3,'asus-a41-x550-x550a-x550b-a450-p550-f550-laptop-battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(172,'LPBT028','HP OA04 ORIGINAL LAPTOP BATTERY',1,5000.0000,8500.0000,0.0000,'2ffb3b8ec034400ca6ad730bfe65d392.jpeg',88,85,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>Key Specifications:</p><div><div><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Battery Type:</strong> Li-ion</li><li><strong>Voltage:</strong> 14.8V</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 2600mAh</li><li><strong>Cells:</strong> 4</li><li><strong>Color:</strong> Black</li><li><strong>Weight:</strong> Around 0.5 kg</li>\r\n<li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 30 x 15 x 5 cm \r\n<div></div></li></ul></div><p>Compatibility:</p>\r\n<div>The battery is compatible with various HP models, including: <div><ul><li>HP 15-G012DX</li><li>HP 15-G019WM</li><li>HP 15-R011DX</li><li>HP 15-R029WM</li><li>HP 15-R030WM</li><li>HP 15-R063NR</li><li>HP O