&lt;/svg&gt;</div><p>Key Specifications:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Output Voltage:</strong> 20V DC</li><li><strong>Output Current:</strong> 3.25A</li><li><strong>Output Power:</strong> 65W</li><li><strong>Connector Type:</strong> 5.5mm x 2.5mm (outer diameter x inner diameter)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Connector Pin Color:</strong> Yellow \r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></li></ul></div><p>Compatibility:</p><div><div>This type of adapter is compatible with various Lenovo laptop models, particularly those that use a 20V, 3.25A power supply with the 5.5mm x 2.5mm connector. Some compatible models include: Lenovo IdeaPad series, Lenovo Yoga series, Lenovo Flex series, and Lenovo ThinkPad series.</div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,7,'lenovo-20v-325a-65w-yellow-pin-power-adapter-55mm25mm',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,1,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(195,'PAD010','ACER 19V 3.42A 65W YELLOW PIN POWER ADAPTER (5.5MM*1.7MM)',1,1100.0000,2800.0000,0.0000,'fb253769fb1782d3a46c516883549f6a.jpeg',84,NULL,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,1,'acer-19v-342a-65w-yellow-pin-power-adapter-55mm17mm',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,1,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(196,'PAD012','ACER 19V 3.42A 65W POWER ADAPTER (3.0MM*1.1MM)',1,1100.0000,2800.0000,0.0000,'aff562466d519ab00001995551b28903.jpeg',84,NULL,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'acer-19v-342a-65w-power-adapter-30mm11mm',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,3,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(197,'PAD015','TOSHIBA 19V 3.42A 65W MIDDLE PIN POWER ADAPTER (5.5MM*2.5MM)',1,1100.0000,2800.0000,0.0000,'12d72bef4aadf4311cde193b