B6S, HSTNN-DB6T, HSTNN-LB6R</li><li><strong>Other Considerations:</strong> Some vendors also specify 100% new from the manufacturer and CE/FCC/ROHS certification for safety.</li></ul></div></div>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,5,'hp-pavilion-15-ab-15-an-17-g-14-ab-laptop-battery-ki04',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,5,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(205,'LPBT006','HP PAVILION 15 14 LAPTOP BATTERY LA04',1,3800.0000,8000.0000,0.0000,'57f0aefd7a464f2beae14306a77ae3a4.jpeg',88,85,'','','','','','',7.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The LA04 battery is a common 4-cell Lithium-Ion battery for HP Pavilion 14 and 15 TouchSmart series laptops. It has a <mark>capacity of 41Wh, a voltage of 14.8V (compatible with 14.4V), and is typically able to provide 1.5-2.5 hours of operation time</mark>. It\\\'s also compatible with other HP models like the 248, 340, and 350 series. You can find it under various part numbers, including 776622-001, 728460-001, and HSTNN-UB5M. </p><div><div><br><p>Key Specifications:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Lithium-Ion</li><li><strong>Voltage:</strong> 14.8V (compatible with 14.4V)</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 41Wh (4 cells)</li><li><strong>Operation Time:</strong> 1.5-2.5 hours</li>\r\n<li><strong>Recharge Cycles:</strong> Up to 1000 \r\n<div></div></li></ul></div><p>Compatible HP Models:\r\n</p><ul><li>HP Pavilion 14 Series</li><li>HP Pavilion 14 TouchSmart Series</li><li>HP Pavilion 15 Series</li><li>HP Pavilion 15 TouchSmart Series</li><li>HP 248 Series</li><li>HP 340 Series</li><li>HP 350 Series</li><li>HP 248 G1 Series</li><li>HP 340 G1 Series</li><li>HP 350 G1 Series</li><li>HP 340 G2 Series</li><li>HP 345 G1 Series</li><li>HP 345 G2 Series</li><li>HP 350 G2 Series</li><li>HP 355 G1 Series</li><li>HP 355 G2 Series</li></ul></div>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL