e HS04 battery has a capacity of 2600mAh or 41Wh and is compatible with 14.4V. </p>\r\n<div><br><p>HS03 and HS04 Battery Specifications:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>HS03:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>3-cell</li><li>10.95V</li></ul></li><li><strong>HS04:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>4-cell</li><li>14.8V (compatible with 14.4V)</li><li>2600mAh/41Wh</li>\r\n<li>Li-ion battery \r\n</li></ul></li></ul></div><p>Compatible HP Laptop Models:</p><ul>\r\n<li>HP 240 G4, 240 G5</li><li>HP 245 G4, 245 G5</li><li>HP 246 G4, 246 G5</li><li>HP 250 G4, 250 G5</li><li>HP 255 G4, 255 G5</li><li>HP 256 G4, 256 G5</li><li>HP Pavilion 14-ac0XX, 14-ac1XX, 14-af0XX</li><li>HP Pavilion 14g-ad1XX, 14q-aj1XX</li><li>HP Pavilion 15-ac0XX, 15-af0XX, 15-ay</li><li>HP Pavilion 15-ba, 15g-ad0XX, 15q-aj0XX</li><li>HP Pavilion 15-ac, 15-af, 15-am</li><li>HP Pavilion 14-ad, 14q-aj</li><li>HP Notebook 14 Series, 14g Series</li><li>HP Notebook 15 Series, 15g Series</li><li>HP 340 G3, 346 G3, 348 G3, 348 G4</li></ul>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,6800.0000,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,5,'hp-pavilion-14-ac-15-ac-240-245-laptop-battery-hs04-hs0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(208,'LPBT013','HP PROBOOK 450 G3 LAPTOP BATTERY RI04',1,3800.0000,8000.0000,0.0000,'9bbe2b33f27bc0e45e88fce632648485.jpeg',88,85,'','','','','','',3.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The RI04 battery for the HP ProBook 450 G3 laptop is a <mark>4-cell, 14.8V Li-ion battery with a capacity of 2600mAh (38Wh)</mark>. It is compatible with various HP ProBook and Envy models, including the ProBook 450, 450 G3, 455, 455 G3, 470, and 470 G3 series, as well as the Envy 15-q001tx. </p>\r\n<div><div>Key specifications:<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Battery Type:</strong> Li-ion</li><li><strong>Voltage:</strong> 14.8V</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 2600mAh / 38Wh</li><li><strong>Cells:</strong> 4-cell</li><li><strong>Color:</strong> Black</li><li><strong>Compatibl