00,'no_image.png',85,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTGS WARRANTY</p>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,1,'acer-aspire-es1-111m-es1-522-es1-533-es1-571-es1-731-es',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,7,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(267,'LPBT012','DELL LATITUDE 3380 3480 3490 LAPTOP BATTERY 33YDH',1,8750.0000,13000.0000,0.0000,'71ebcd8a3dca63c610f5f50adcea087b.jpeg',85,NULL,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The 33YDH battery is a 4-cell Lithium-ion battery for various Dell Latitude and Inspiron laptops. It has a <mark>capacity of 56Wh (3500mAh) and a voltage of 15.2V</mark>. It\\\'s a replacement battery compatible with Latitude 3380, 3480, 3490, 3580, 3590, and Inspiron 7577, 7773, 7778, 7779, 7786 models, and G3 and G5 series. </p>\r\n<div><div><div><p>Specifications:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Battery Type:</strong> Lithium-ion</li><li><strong>Voltage:</strong> 15.2V</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 56Wh / 3500mAh</li>\r\n<li><strong>Cell Count:</strong> 4 cells \r\n<div></div></li></ul></div>\r\n<div>Compatible Models:<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Dell Latitude:</strong> 3380, 3480, 3490, 3580, 3590, 3400, 3500</li><li><strong>Dell Inspiron:</strong> 17 7000, 7577, 7773, 7778, 7786, 7779 (2-in-1 series), 7586 2-in-1</li><li><strong>Dell G3:</strong> 15 3579, 17 3779</li><li><strong>Dell G5:</strong> 15 5587</li><li><strong>Dell G7:</strong> 15 7588</li><li><strong>Dell Vostro:</strong> 15 7580, 7570</li></ul></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,4,'dell-latitude-3380-3480-3490-laptop-battery33ydh',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,5,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(268,'ULAP014','USED HP PROBOOK 430 G7 I5 11TH 1135G7 | 16GB RAM | 256GB SSD | 13.3INCH | BACKLIT | WIN 11',1,73500.0000,114000.0000,0.0000,'no_image.png',89,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'',NULL,'standard',19,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,5,'used-hp-probook-430-g7-i5-11th-1135g7-16gb-ram-256gb-ss',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(269,'ULAP044','USED DELL LATITUDE 5310 I5 10TH 10310U | 8GB | 256GB | TOUCH | 13.3INCH | 360 ROTATABLE LAPTOP',1,65000.0000,87000.0000,0.0000,'no_image.png',89,NULL,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p>',NULL,'standard',11,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,4,'used-dell-latitude-5310-i5-10th-10310u-8gb-256gb-touch-',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,4,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(271,'OTH003','SCREEN CLEANER KIT FH-HB021',1,200.0000,700.0000,0.0000,'ff8f7d7603d45ec223ebe70797813f6f.jpeg',46,NULL,'','','','','','',17.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>A typical screen cleaner kit includes <mark>a microfiber cloth and a cleaning solution, often in a spray bottle</mark>. Some kits may also include a brush or a special applicator for cleaning specific types of screens. The cleaning solution is usually alcohol-free and designed to be safe for various screens, including LCDs, LEDs, and OLEDs.</p><div><p>Here\\\'s a more detailed breakdown of what to expect in a screen cleaner kit:</p>\r\n<div>1. Microfiber Cloth: <div><ul><li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Gently removes dirt, fingerprints, and smudges from screens without leaving streaks or lint.</li><li><strong>Material:</strong> Made of synthetic fibers that are effective at absorbing particles.</li></ul><p>2. Cleaning Solution:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<div><strong>Purpose:</strong><p>Dissolves grime, grease, and other stubborn stains that the cloth can\\\'t remove alone. </p>\r\n</div></li><li><strong>Types:</strong><ul><li><strong>Spray Bottle:</strong> Typically contains a liquid solution that can be sprayed directly onto the screen or onto the cloth. \r\n</li><li><strong>Mist Bottle:</strong> Similar to a spray bottle, but the solution is released in a mist-like spray. </li></ul></li></ul></div></div><li><strong>Ingredients:</strong><p>Often formulated to be alcohol-free, ammonia-free, and non-toxic to prevent damage to screen coatings. </p></li><li><strong>Volume:</strong><p>Can range from small portable bottles (e.g., 60ml) to larger sizes (e.g., 200ml or 475ml). </p></li></div><p>3. Optional Accessories: </p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Brush:</strong> For cleaning hard-to-reach areas or removing dust from screen protectors.</li><li><strong>Applicator:</strong> Some kits may include a special applicator for applying the cleaning solution to the screen.</li></ul><p>4. Additional Features:</p><ul><li>\r\n<div><strong>Packaging:</strong><p>Some kits come in convenient, hard-shell cases for storage and portability. </p>\r\n</div></li><li><strong>Biodegradability:</strong><p>Some cleaning solutions are designed to be biodegradable, making them environmentally friendly. </p></li><li><strong>Static Electricity Prevention:</strong><p>Some kits may include features to prevent static electricity buildup on the screen.</p></li></ul>',NULL,'standard',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'screen-cleaner-kit-fh-hb021',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,11,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(272,'OTH004','POP-UP MOBILE EXTERNAL DVD WRITTER',1,2900.0000,5900.0000,0.0000,'916a21850fd357404a62cb96fddbd398.jpeg',46,NULL,'','','','','','',1.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p> Pop-up Mobile External DVD Writer, also known as a Portable DVD Drive, is <mark>a device that connects to a computer via USB and allows you to read and write DVDs and CDs</mark>. These devices are designed for portability, making them ideal for laptops, desktops, and other computers that may not have an internal DVD drive.</p>\r\n<div><div><div><p>Key Features:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Typically uses USB 3.0 or USB-C for faster data transfer. \r\n<div></div></li><li><strong>Read/Write Functionality:</strong> Can read and write DVDs and CDs, including common formats like DVD-ROM, DVD-R, DVD-RW, DVD+R, DVD+RW, CD-ROM, CD-R, and CD-RW. </li><li><strong>Read Speeds:</strong> Typically offer maximum read speeds of 24x for CDs and 8x for DVDs. </li><li><strong>Write Speeds:</strong> Write speeds vary depending on the specific model and media type, but commonly offer 24x for CD-R, 8x for DVD-R, and 4x for DVD-RW. </li><li><strong>Portability:</strong> Designed to be slim and lightweight, making them easy to transport and store. </li><li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Typically compatible with Windows, macOS, and Linux operating systems. </li></ul></div><p>Benefits of Using a Pop-Up Mobile External DVD Writer:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Replaying and Burning Discs:</strong> Can be used to play DVDs or burn CDs. \r\n<div></div></li><li><strong>Software Installation:</strong> Allows installation of software from DVDs. </li><li><strong>Backing Up Data:</strong> Enables backing up data to DVDs. </li><li><strong>Portability:</strong> Ideal for laptops or computers without a built-in optical drive.</li></ul></div></div>',NULL,'standard',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'pop-up-mobile-external-dvd-writter',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(273,'ST007','LEXAR NM620 1TB NVME',1,19000.0000,21000.0000,0.0000,'bc03c46014b051bb7e8a38fcd395b72d.jpg',67,99,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>03 YEARS WARRANTY</p>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,19,'lexar-nm620-1tb-nvme',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,3,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(274,'ST010','ADATA LEGEND LEG-710 2TB NVME',1,30000.0000,34000.0000,0.0000,'0b80de57bb1b5eb5ac14d62eabb9c170.jpeg',67,99,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>03 YEARS WARRANTY</p><p>The ADATA LEGEND 710 2TB NVMe SSD is a PCIe Gen3 x4 M.2 2280 drive with a capacity of 2TB. It offers a <mark>sequential read speed of up to 2,400MB/s and a sequential write speed of up to 1,800MB/s</mark>. It also features up to 200K 4KB Random Read IOPS and 150K 4KB Random Write IOPS.</p>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,12,'adata-legend-leg-710-2tb-nvme',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,5,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(275,'ST001','TEAM MP33 PRO 1TB NVME',1,18000.0000,21000.0000,0.0000,'0052a5bc154be4dc3859274c96793c04.jpeg',67,99,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>03 YEARS WARRANTY</p><p>The TEAMGROUP MP33 PRO 1TB NVMe SSD offers a M.2 form factor, utilizing PCIe Gen3 x4 and NVMe 1.3 technology for high-speed data transfer. It features a <mark>1TB storage capacity and has read speeds up to 2,400/2,100 MB/s</mark>. The drive\\\'s dimensions are 80(L) x 22(W) x 3.8(H) mm, and it weighs 6g. It is compatible with Windows and Linux operating systems.</p>\r\n<div><div><br><p>Key Features:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Form Factor:</strong> M.2 2280</li><li><strong>Interface:</strong> PCIe 3.0 x4 with NVMe 1.3</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 1 TB</li><li><strong>Read Speed:</strong> Up to 2,400 MB/s</li><li><strong>Write Speed:</strong> Up to 1,700 MB/s</li><li><strong>Flash Memory Type:</strong> TLC</li><li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 80(L) x 22(W) x 3.8(H) mm</li><li><strong>Weight:</strong> 6g</li><li><strong>Operating System Compatibility:</strong> Windows 11/10/8.1/8/7, Linux 2.6.33 or later</li><li><strong>IOPS (Read/Write):</strong> 220K/200K IOPS Max</li><li><strong>MTBF (Mean Time Between Failures):</strong> 2,000,000 hours</li></ul></div></div>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'team-mp33-pro-1tb-nvme',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(276,'SD001','TEAM 32GB MICRO SD',1,1200.0000,1900.0000,0.0000,'9029653e97220443077df797f05861cb.jpeg',59,NULL,'','','','','','',3.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>03 YEARS WARRANTY</p><p>A 32GB TEAMGROUP microSDHC UHS-I U1 Class 10 memory card offers a <mark>read speed of up to 80MB/s and a write speed of up to 20MB/s</mark>. It supports UHS-I ultrahigh-speed bus interface and is suitable for various devices like smartphones, tablets, and cameras. It also comes with a full-size SDHC/SDXC adapter. </p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><p>Key Specifications:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Brand:</strong> TEAMGROUP</li><li><strong>Type:</strong> microSDHC</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 32GB</li><li><strong>Speed Class:</strong> UHS-I / U1 / Class 10</li><li><strong>Read Speed:</strong> Up to 80MB/s</li><li><strong>Write Speed:</strong> Up to 20MB/s</li><li><strong>IOPS (Input/Output Operations per Second):</strong> 500 for reading and 150 for writing</li><li><strong>Compatible Devices:</strong> Smartphones, tablets, cameras</li><li><strong>Adapter:</strong> Includes a full-size SDHC/SDXC adapter</li><li><strong>Warranty:</strong> Lifetime warranty</li>\r\n<li><strong>Operating System:</strong> FAT32 format \r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></li></ul></div><p>Features and Benefits:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>High Speeds:</strong> UHS-I support and high read/write speeds allow for fast data transfer. \r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></li><li><strong>Class 10:</strong> Ensures a minimum write speed of 10MB/s, suitable for Full HD video recording. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>IOPS:</strong> Excellent IOPS ratings for fast access to data, making it suitable for high-speed applications. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Durability:</strong> Offers all-around protection with shockproof, temperature-proof, waterproof, magnetic-proof, and X-ray-proof features. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Wide Compatibility:</strong> Works with a variety of devices and systems.</li></ul></div>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'team-32gb-micro-sd',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(277,'SD002','TEAM 128GB MICRO SD',1,2900.0000,3900.0000,0.0000,'no_image.png',59,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>03 YEARS WARRANTY</p>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'team-128gb-micro-sd',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,1,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(278,'COLPD004','MEETION CP3030 COOLING PAD',1,3200.0000,5500.0000,0.0000,'e26a07a185f2351fbf0950ce0b0f12ea.png',54,NULL,'','','','','','',3.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The MEETION CP3030 is a gaming laptop cooling pad with <mark>5 silent fans, RGB illumination, and adjustable stand</mark>. It\\\'s compatible with laptops ranging from 9\\\" to 15.6\\\" in size. The pad\\\'s dimensions are 370 x 265 x 32 mm, and it weighs approximately 740 grams. It offers 2 USB ports for power and potential data transfer, and the cable length is 60 ± 2 cm according to the product description. </p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div>\r\n<p>Here\\\'s a more detailed breakdown of the specifications:</p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div>\r\n<p>General:</p><ul><li><strong>Model:</strong> CP3030</li><li><strong>Material:</strong> ABS plastic</li><li><strong>Cooling Method:</strong> Air cooling with 5 fans</li><li><strong>RGB Illumination:</strong> Yes</li><li><strong>Adjustable Stand:</strong> Yes <div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></div></li></ul></div>\r\n<p>Dimensions and Weight:</p><ul><li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 370 x 265 x 32 mm</li><li><strong>Weight:</strong> 740 ± 5 g <di