microphone combo, and potentially other ports depending on the specific configuration. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Other:</strong> Fingerprint reader, webcam, Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth.</li></ul></div></div>',NULL,'standard',19,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,5,'hp-probook-430-g8-i5-11th-1135g7-16gb-ram-256gb-ssd-133',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,5,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(289,'URAM010','USED DDR3 8GB 1333/1600MHZ LAPTOP RAM',1,2000.0000,4000.0000,0.0000,'94470df1a6c2108b852f76916540a423.jpeg',62,NULL,'','','','','','',1.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p>',NULL,'standard',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'used-ddr3-8gb-13331600mhz-laptop-ram',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,20,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(290,'ULAP009','USED DELL LATITUDE 5490 I5 7TH 7300U | 8GB RAM | 256GB | BACKLIT | 14INCH | 180 DEGREE LAPTOP',1,48000.0000,65000.0000,0.0000,'76a3a00c13d5fa6db9f4fa0f1dbd1933.jpeg',89,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The Dell Latitude 5490 is a 14-inch laptop with an <mark>Intel Core i5-7300U processor, 8GB of RAM, a 256GB SSD, a backlit keyboard, and a 14-inch HD display</mark>. It also features an 180-degree hinge for flexible viewing. </p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><p>Here\\\'s a more detailed breakdown of the specifications:</p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><p>Processor: Intel Core i5-7300U (7th generation).<br>RAM: 8GB DDR4.<br>Storage: 256GB SSD (Solid State Drive).<br>Display: 14-inch HD (1366 x 768).<br>Graphics: Integrated Intel HD Graphics 620.<br>Keyboard: Backlit.<br>Operating System: Windows 10 Professional (often included).<br>Ports: 3x USB 3.1 Gen 1, USB-C 3.1 Gen 2/DisplayPort, HDMI.<br>Connectivity: Intel Wireless-AC 9560, Bluetooth 5.0, Gigabit Ethernet. </p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><div>Other features:<ul>\r\n<li>Webcam.</li><li>Stereo speakers.</li><li>Microphone.</li><li>Fingerprint scanner (optional).</li><li>180-degree hinge for versatile viewing.</li><li>Anti-glare display (some configurations).</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',19,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'used-dell-latitude-5490-i5-7th-7300u-8gb-ram-256gb-back',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(292,'LAPKEY002','HP ELITEBOOK 840 G3/G4 WITH BACKLIGHT LAPTOP KEYBOARD',1,4500.0000,7500.0000,0.0000,'4d8556180f38e4edc64a0e198faef419.jpg',87,NULL,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The HP EliteBook 840 G3/G4 laptop has a backlit keyboard that illuminates the keys, making it easier to type in low-light conditions. The keyboard is designed with a standard US layout and is generally built for durability. The backlight can be controlled by pressing the Fn key along with a designated backlight key, often F5, F9, or F11, according to HP\\\'s tech takes.</p><p>Here\\\'s a more detailed breakdown:</p><p>Key Features:</p><p>Backlight: The keys are illuminated, allowing for easy typing in dark environments. </p><p>Standard US Layout: The keyboard follows a standard US layout for easy use. </p><p>Durability: The keyboard is built to withstand daily wear and tear. </p><p>Control: The backlight can be turned on or off by pressing the Fn key along with a designated backlight key (often F5, F9, or F11), according to HP\\\'s support page. </p><p>Compatibility: The keyboard is designed to fit HP EliteBook 840 G3/G4 models, and other compatible models such as 745 G3/G4, 848 G4, 836308-001/821177-001. </p><p>How to turn on/off the backlight:</p><p>Locate the Backlight Key: Find the key on your keyboard that is marked with a keyboard illumination icon, often F5, F9, or F11.</p><p>Press Fn + Backlight Key: Press and hold the Fn key and then press the designated backlight key.</p><p>Cycle Through Brightness Levels (if applicable): You may need to press the Fn + Backlight key combination multiple times to cycle through different brightness levels. </p>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,5,'hp-elitebook-840-g3g4-with-backlight-laptop-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,7,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(293,'ULAP012','USED DELL INSPIRON 3501 I3 11TH GEN 1115G4 | 8GB | 128GB | 1TB | 15.6INCH LAPTOP',1,40000.0000,95000.0000,0.0000,'8de45e7b150bf87f9046c00b6ce00c3c.jpeg',89,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><div>AI Overview<div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div>\r\n<div><div>The Dell Inspiron 3501 with an Intel Core i3-1115G4 processor, 8GB of RAM, and a 1TB HDD has a <mark>15.6-inch Full HD display, Intel UHD Graphics, and a webcam</mark>. It runs on Windows 10 or Windows 11. \r\n<div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div>\r\n<p>Here\\\'s a more detailed breakdown:</p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div>\r\n<p>Processor: Intel Core i3-1115G4 (11th Generation).<br>RAM: 8GB DDR4.<br>Storage: 1TB Hard Disk Drive (HDD) or 128GB SSD (depending on the specific configuration).<br>Display: 15.6-inch Full HD (1920 x 1080).<br>Graphics: Intel UHD Graphics.<br>Webcam: HD Webcam. </p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div>\r\n<p>Operating System: Windows 10 or Windows 11.<br>Ports and Slots: Typically includes SD card reader, USB ports, HDMI port, and audio jack.<br>Other features: Some models may include a numeric keypad, Dell Mobile Connect for phone integration, and a black finish.<br>Dimensions: Around 9.8 x 14.33 x 0.71 inches (24.89 x 36.4 x 1.8 cm).<br>Weight: Around 4.04 pounds (1.83 kg).</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',19,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL