.0000,NULL,3,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(345,'LAPKEY029','LENOVO IDEAPAD 100-15IBY 80MJ 100-15 LAPTOP KEYBOARD',1,3000.0000,6000.0000,0.0000,'6aa6766cef4d0f4155404ec0f1509521.jpg',87,NULL,'','','','','','',1.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTH WARRANTY</p><p>Lenovo Ideapad 100-15 keyboard / Lenovo Ideapad 100-15IBY keyboard</p><p>Lenovo Ideapad 100-15IBY keyboard / Lenovo Ideapad 100-15IBD keyboard</p><p>Lenovo Ideapad B50-10 keyboard / Lenovo Ideapad B50-50 keyboard</p><p>Lenovo Ideapad 300-15 keyboard</p>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,7,'lenovo-ideapad-100-15iby-80mj-100-15-laptop-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,6,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(346,'LAPKEY001','TOSHIBA SATELLITE C50 C55D-A C50D LAPTOP KEYBOARD',1,3000.0000,4500.0000,0.0000,'58c880f4a138f1a2efb876c50c3a461b.jpg',87,NULL,'','','','','','',1.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code25',NULL,'<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The keyboard for Toshiba Satellite C50, C55D-A, and C50D laptops is a US standard layout, black, and designed for easy installation and compatibility with various Toshiba Satellite models. It\\\'s built for durability and reliability, featuring keys designed to withstand daily use, making it suitable for both personal and professional use. </p><p>Key Features:</p><p>US Standard Layout: Ensures accurate and efficient typing. </p><p>Black Color: Adds a sleek, modern look. </p><p>Durable and Reliable: Designed to withstand daily use and spills. </p><p>Easy Installation: User-friendly design for straightforward replacement. </p><p>Wide Compatibility: Works with a range of Toshiba Satellite models, including C50, C50D, C50-A, C50-A506, C50D-A, C55, C55T, C55D, C55-A, and C55D-A. </p><p>Detailed Specifications:</p><p>Model: Various Toshiba Satellite models, including those mentioned above.</p><p>Color: Black.</p><p>Layout: US Standard.</p><p>Compatibility: Works with specific part numbers like V143070CS1, MP-11B53US-930B, and 6037B0084402.</p><p>Note: This keyboard is not compatible with the Toshiba C50-B and C50D-B series. </p>',NULL,'standard',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'toshiba-satellite-c50-c55d-a-c50d-laptop-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,63,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(347,'OTH001','FOAM CLEANER',1,350.0000,1000.0000,0.0000,'8cca26249e62a8ef69715c6c9b2e12ee.jpg',46,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>Foam cleaners are often used for various applications, from cleaning foam guns to removing grime from surfaces. They come in various forms, including aerosols, and their specifications can vary. Generally, they are <mark>formulated to effectively clean, remove contaminants, and sometimes even prevent clogging</mark>.</p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><p>Here\\\'s a more detailed look at common specifications:</p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><p>Packaging and Form:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Aerosol cans:</strong> These are a popular form, allowing for easy application and storage. \r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></li><li><strong>Spray bottles:</strong> These can also be used for more targeted cleaning. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Content:</strong> Typical sizes include 150ml, 400ml, 500ml, and 650ml. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li></ul></div><p>Composition and Ingredients:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Solvents:</strong> Common solvents include acetone, propane, isobutane, and other hydrocarbon solvents. \r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></li><li><strong>Surfactants:</strong> These help to lift dirt and grease. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Propellants:</strong> Aerosol cans often use propellants like propane and butane. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Water:</strong> Some foam cleaners are water-based. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Other additives:</strong> Some foam cleaners may include anti-static agents or metal-detectable components. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li></ul></div><p>Cleaning Properties:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Foaming action:</strong> This helps the cleaner to cling to surfaces and extend the cleaning time. \r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></li><li><strong>Cleaning effectiveness:</strong> They are designed to remove various types of contaminants, including grime, grease, and uncured polyurethane foam. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Vertical surface cleaning:</strong> Some cleaners are formulated to work well on vertical surfaces, preventing runoff. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li></ul></div><p>Safety and Storage:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<div><div><div><strong>Storage:</strong><p>Foam cleaners should be stored in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight and heat sources. </p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li>\r\n<p><strong>Shelf life:</strong>\r\n</p><p>Many foam cleaners have a guaranteed shelf life, typically 24 months from production date. </p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div>\r\n</div></div></div></li><li>\r\n<p><strong>Safety warnings:</strong>\r\n</p><p>Always follow the manufacturer\\\'s instructions and safety guidelines when using foam cleaners. </p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div>\r\n</div></div></div></li></ul></div><p>Specific Applications:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<div><div><div><strong>Foam gun cleaning:</strong><p>Some cleaners are specifically designed to remove uncured polyurethane foam from foam guns. </p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li>\r\n<p><strong>Surface cleaning:</strong>\r\n</p><p>Many foam cleaners are used for general surface cleaning, including on plastics, metal, glass, and synthetic surfaces. </p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div>\r\n</div></div></div></li><li>\r\n<p><strong>Industrial cleaning:</strong>\r\n</p><p>Some foam cleaners are suitable for use in food processing areas and other industrial environments.</p></li></ul>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'foam-cleaner',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,7,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(348,'THPST001','MX-6 ARCTIC THERMAL PASTE 8g',1,1000.0000,3500.0000,0.0000,'96bd1ea519f58e63015d0e2612d1b317.jpeg',51,NULL,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>The ARCTIC MX-6 is an 8g thermal paste with a <mark>thermal conductivity of 7.5 W/mK, a viscosity of 45,000 poise, a density of 2.6 g/cm³, and a working temperature range of -50~150°C</mark>. It is non-conductive and non-capacitive, ensuring safety and preventing potential damage to components. The paste is grey in color and comes in a syringe for easy application.</p>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'mx-6-arctic-thermal-paste-8g',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,18,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(349,'LAPRAM001','TRANSCEND DDR4 16GB 3200MHZ LAPTOP RAM',1,9000.0000,12000.0000,0.0000,'939cb76c9de3a7a82d6b4b51cf93777d.jpeg',62,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>03 YEAR WARRANTY</p><p>Model: Transcend 16GB</p><p>Capacity- 16GB</p><p>260-pin SO DIMM</p><p>Durable Construction</p><p>Frequency speed – 3200 MHz</p><p>DIMM Type: 260-Pin SO-DIMM</p>',NULL,'standard',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,22,'transcend-ddr4-16gb-3200mhz-laptop-ram',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,1,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(350,'LAPFAN012','ASUS TUF FA507 FA707 FX507 FX707 LAPTOP GPU FAN',1,9000.0000,10500.0000,0.0000,'c87096556c9eba1646c4d305164d1873.jpg',88,81,'','','','','','',1.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>01 MONTH WARRANTY</p>',NULL,'s