0V and 4.5A is a power adapter designed for Lenovo laptops, particularly those with the older, distinctive \\\"USB-PIN\\\" or \\\"yellow-tip\\\" connector. It provides <mark>90 watts of power (20V * 4.5A) to charge the laptop</mark>. </p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><p>Key Specifications:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Output Voltage:</strong> 20V</li><li><strong>Output Current:</strong> 4.5A</li><li><strong>Output Power:</strong> 90W (20V * 4.5A)</li>\r\n<li><strong>Connector:</strong> USB-PIN (also known as a yellow-tip connector) \r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></li><li><strong>Input:</strong> 100-240V, 50/60Hz (suitable for worldwide use) <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Primarily for Lenovo ThinkPad and IdeaPad series laptops, but confirm compatibility with your specific model <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Protection Features:</strong> Over-current, over-voltage, short circuit, over-heating, overload, surge, and under-voltage protection are common features <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li></ul></div></div></ul>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,7,'lenovo-20v-45a-90w-usb-pin-power-adapter',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,11,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(389,'PAD028','ASUS 19V 3.42A 65W SMALL PIN POWER ADAPTER (5.5MM*2.5MM)',1,1500.0000,3000.0000,0.0000,'3e9945dae640a977b191f143a3646cf8.jpeg',84,NULL,'','','','','','',2.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The ASUS 19V 3.42A 65W power adapter with a 5.5mm x 2.5mm connector is a common type used with many ASUS laptops. It <mark>provides 19 volts of output voltage at 3.42 amps, totaling 65 watts of power</mark>. The connector is a standard barrel type, often referred to as a \\\"small pin\\\" in the context of ASUS laptop chargers.</p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><p>Detailed Specifications:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Input Voltage:</strong> 100-240V (suitable for use with various power outlets worldwide). \r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></li><li><strong>Output Voltage:</strong> 19V DC. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Output Current:</strong> 3.42A. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Power Output:</strong> 65W. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Connector Type:</strong> 5.5mm x 2.5mm (outer diameter x inner diameter) barrel connector. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Primarily compatible with ASUS laptops requiring a 19V 3.42A adapter with the specified connector. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Safety Features:</strong> Often includes features like over-current, over-temperature, and short circuit protection. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Common Adapter Models:</strong> May be compatible with models such as ADP-65DW B, ADP-65JH BB, EXA0703YH, and others.</li></ul></div></div>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,3,'asus-19v-342a-65w-small-pin-power-adapter-55mm25mm',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,4,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(390,'PAD029','ASUS 19V 4.74A 90W SMALL PIN POWER ADAPTER (4.5MM*3.0MM)',1,1200.0000,3000.0000,0.0000,'7294cd6ff9746524c0a791f778190041.jpeg',84,NULL,'','','','','','',2.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The ASUS 19V 4.74A 90W power adapter with a 4.5mm * 3.0mm connector is a standard adapter for many ASUS laptops. It <mark>provides an output of 19 volts at 4.74 amps, delivering a total of 90 watts of power</mark>. The 4.5mm * 3.0mm connector is a specific size and type of barrel connector used by ASUS for some of their laptops. </p><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;<p>Here\\\'s a breakdown of the specifications: </p>\r\n<div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;<ul><li><strong>Output Voltage:</strong> 19V (Volts)</l