tage:</strong> 19.5V</li><li><strong>Output Current:</strong> 6.15A</li><li><strong>Power:</strong> 120W</li><li><strong>Connector Size:</strong> 5.5mm x 2.5mm</li><li><strong>Input Voltage:</strong> 100-240V, 50-60Hz (compatible with standard global power outlets)</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,1,'acer-195v-615a-120w-power-adapter-55mm25mm-chicony',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,1,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(397,'PAD037','SONY 19.5V 4.7A 90W SMALL POWER ADAPTER (6.5MM*4.4MM)',1,2800.0000,4000.0000,0.0000,'af8e1c15b3f5c582ab5cea77156a4cdd.jpeg',84,NULL,'','','','','','',1.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The SONY 19.5V 4.7A 90W small power adapter (6.5mm*4.4mm) has a <mark>DC output of 19.5V and 4.7A, delivering 90 watts of power</mark>. It has a 6.5mm outer diameter and 4.4mm inner diameter connector with a pin inside. The adapter accepts an input voltage of 100-240V and a frequency of 50-60Hz. It is compatible with various Sony VAIO laptops and other devices that require these specific power specifications and connector type. </p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><div>Detailed Specifications:<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Output Voltage:</strong> 19.5V DC</li><li><strong>Output Current:</strong> 4.7A</li><li><strong>Power:</strong> 90W</li><li><strong>Input Voltage:</strong> 100-240V AC, 50-60Hz</li><li><strong>Connector Size:</strong> 6.5mm (outer diameter) * 4.4mm (inner diameter) with a pin inside</li><li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Sony VAIO laptops (various models) and other devices requiring this power specification and connector type</li><li><strong>Cable Length:</strong> Total length of approximately 10 feet (AC power cord and DC power cable)</li><li><strong>Package Includes:</strong> 1x AC adapter, 1x DC power line</li></ul></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'sony-195v-47a-90w-small-power-adapter-65mm44mm',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,3,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(398,'LPBT069','HP BN03XL LAPTOP BATTERY',1,8900.0000,12900.0000,0.0000,'2f4c02fe040a48486e452eebce10be2e.jpeg',85,NULL,'','','','','','',1.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The HP BN03XL laptop battery is a <mark>lithium-ion battery with a voltage of 11.55V and a capacity of 51Wh (or 4185mAh)</mark>. It is a replacement battery for various HP Envy x360 models, including the 13-BA, 13-AY, 15-ED, and 15-EE series. The battery is also compatible with certain HP Pavilion 14-EH models. </p>\r\n<div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;<p>Key Specifications:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Model:</strong> BN03XL</li><li><strong>Voltage:</strong> 11.55V</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 51Wh / 4185mAh</li><li><strong>Battery Type:</strong> Li-ion</li><li><strong>Condition:</strong> Typically sold as brand new</li><li><strong>Compatible Part Numbers:</strong> BN03XL, L76965-271, HSTNN-DB9N, HSTNN-OB1O, L73965-271, L76965-2C1, L76965-AC1, L76985-271, L77034-005, L770374-005</li><li><strong>Compatible Models:</strong> HP Envy x360 13-BA, 13-AY, 13-BD, 15-ED, 15-EE, 15-ES, 15-EU series, and some HP Pavilion 14-EH series</li></ul></div>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,5,'hp-bn03xl-laptop-battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,1,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(399,'LAPKEY040','DELL LATITUDE E7440 LAPTOP KEYBOARD WITH BACKLIGHT',1,4750.0000,7900.0000,0.0000,'no_image.png',87,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The Dell Latitude E7440 laptop keyboard has a backlight feature. It <mark>uses a US or US/International layout with 79-83 keys, depending on the region</mark>. You can enable or disable the backlight using the <code>Fn</code> + <code>F10</code> keys. </p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><p>Details:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Backlight:</strong> The keyboard is backlit, allowing for visibility in low-light conditions. \r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></li><li><strong>Layout:</strong> The standard layout for the E7440 keyboard is US or US/International. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Key Count:</strong> The number of keys varies by region: 79 keys for the United States and Canada, 80 for the United Kingdom, and 83 for Japan. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Activation:</strong> The backlight is typically toggled on/off using the <code>Fn</code> + <code>F10</code> key combination. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> The keyboard is compatible with Dell Latitude E7440, E7240, and E7420 series. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Key Pitch:</strong> The key pitch (distance between key centers) is 19.05 mm (0.75 in.) horizontally and 18.05 mm (0.71 in.) vertically.</li></ul></div></div>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,4,'dell-latitude-e7440-laptop-keyboard-with-backlight',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,3,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(400,'LAPKEY041','ACER SWIFT A315-52 LAPTOP KEYBOARD',1,3000.0000,6400.0000,0.0000,'9f58e3a03739a486360a4256ff7b1e4a.jpeg',87,NULL,'','','','','','',1.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The Acer Swift 3 SF315-52 laptop keyboard is a standard, full-size keyboard with <mark>104 keys</mark> and is designed for comfortable typing. It typically features a US layout and may come with or without backlighting. </p>\r\n<div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;<p>Key Features:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Standard Layout:</strong> The keyboard uses a standard US layout, making it familiar and easy to type on for most users. \r\n<div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div>\r\n</div></li><li><strong>Number of Keys:</strong> It has 104 keys, which is standard for a full-size laptop keyboard. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Backlighting:</strong> Some models of the Acer Swift 3 SF315-52 may include backlighting, which can be helpful for typing in low-light conditions. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Ergonomic Design:</strong> The keyboard is designed for a comfortable typing experience. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Durable Construction:</strong> It\\\'s built with quality materials for lasting performance. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li></ul></div><p>Compatibility:</p><ul>\r\n<li>The Acer Swift 3 SF315-52 keyboard is compatible with the Acer Swift 3 SF315-52 series.</li><li>It\\\'s also compatible with some Acer Aspire 3 models, such as the A315-55 and A315-42 series.</li><li>When replacing a keyboard, it\\\'s crucial to ensure proper hinge clip compatibility, as they can vary between keyboard vendors.</li><li>If the keyboard is backlit, you\\\'ll need to confirm the specific version (AC06 or AC60) that matches your laptop.</li></ul>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,1,'acer-swift-a315-52-laptop-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,5,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(401,'LPBT029','TOSHIBA C850 LAPTOP BATTERY',1,4500.0000,7500.0000,0.0000,'d3c03f21917ef5ba92ddffaf35f4dfaf.jpeg',88,85,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The Toshiba Satellite C850 laptop battery is typically a <mark>6-cell, 10.8V or 11.1V, Li-ion battery with a capacity of 4400mAh</mark>. Some higher capacity options, like 9-cell 6600mAh batteries, are also available, but they may extend out from the laptop. Common compatible part numbers include PA5024U-1BRS.</p><div><br><p>Here\\\'s a more detailed breakdown:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Voltage:</strong> 10.8V or 11.1V. \r\n<div></div></li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 4400mAh is common, but 6600mAh batteries are also available. \r\n</li><li><strong>Cell Type:</strong> Li-ion. \r\n</li><li><strong>Number of Cells:</strong> Typically 6 cells, but 9-cell options exist. \r\n</li><li><strong>Compatible Part Numbers:</strong> PA5024U-1BRS is a common one. \r\n</li><li><strong>Safety:</strong> Laptop batteries with over current and voltage protection are available.</li></ul></div>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,52,'toshiba-c850-laptop-battery',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(402,'LPBT070','ASUS VIVOBOOK X542U LAPTOP BATTERY C21N1634',1,5900.0000,8900.0000,0.0000,'e2face6af19aaf0b556cf5e276a1b689.jpeg',85,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>Compatible with Battery code:<br>C21N1634, C21PqCH, 0B200-02550000, 0B200-02550200</p><p>Compatible with Laptop Models: </p><p>A580B, A580U, A580UBA7100, A580UF, A580UR, A580UR7100, A580UR8250, A580UR9000, F542UF, F542UN, F542UQ, FL5900L, R542U, R542UA, R542UA-GQ692T, R542UF, R542UF-DM074T, R542UN, R542UN-DM168T, R542UN-DM198T, R542UN-DM233T, R542UQ, R542UQ-DM393T, R542UQ-GQ410T, V587U, VivoBook 15 X542BA, VivoBook 15 X542BA-DH99, VivoBook 15 X542BP, VivoBook 15 X542UA, VivoBook 15 X542UA-GO254T, VivoBook 15 X542UA-GQ222T, VivoBook 15 X542UF, VivoBook 15 X542UF-DM143T, VivoBook 15 X542UN, VivoBook 15 X542UN-DM055T, VivoBook 15 X542UN-DM128T, VivoBook 15 X542UN-DM129T, VivoBook 15 X542UN-DM162T, VivoBook 15 X542UN-DM242T, VivoBook 15 X542UN-DM243T, VivoBook 15 X542UQ, VivoBook 15 X542UQ-DM026T, VivoBook 15 X542UQ-DM071T, VivoBook 15 X542UQ-DM234T, VivoBook 15 X542UQ-DM336T, VivoBook 15 X542UQ-GQ145T, VivoBook 15 X542UQ-GQ146T, VivoBook 15 X542UQ-GQ222T, VivoBook 15 X542UQ-GQ335T, VivoBook 15 X542UR, VivoBook 15 X542UR-DM110T, VivoBook 15 X542UR-DM220T, VivoBook 15 X542UR-GO216T, VivoBook 15 X542UR-GQ040T, VivoBook F542UF