, G570G, and G575AC laptop keyboards are <mark>standard US QWERTY layouts</mark>, designed for compatibility with these specific Lenovo models. They feature a compact design and are typically durable, offering a reliable typing experience. These keyboards are also designed for easy replacement, should the need arise. </p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><div>Key Specifications:<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Layout:</strong> QWERTY (US standard).</li><li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Lenovo IdeaPad G570, G575, G570G, and G575AC.</li><li><strong>Design:</strong> Compact, potentially with removable keypads for easy replacement.</li><li><strong>Durability:</strong> Designed for everyday use.</li><li><strong>Special Features:</strong> May include features like backlighting (depending on the specific model or configuration).</li></ul></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',16,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,7,'lenovo-g570-g575-g570g-g575ac-laptop-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,7,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(405,'ULAP089','USED LENOVO THINKPAD T470 I5 7200U | 8GB | 256GB | 14INCH | 180 DEGREE LAPTOP',1,0.0000,64000.0000,0.0000,'no_image.png',89,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>03 MONTHS WARRANTY</p>',NULL,'standard',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,7,'used-lenovo-thinkpad-t470-i5-7200u-8gb-256gb-14inch-180',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(406,'LAPKEY043','LENOVO T440 T440P T440S T450 T450S E431 KEYBOARD',1,4300.0000,7500.0000,0.0000,'fda6ba174b7ac0d73ec73b3c2b5669b8.jpg',87,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The Lenovo Thinkpad T440, T440p, T440s, T450, T450s, and E431 all use a similar keyboard with minor variations. These keyboards are <mark>typically QWERTY layout, with a TrackPoint (red pointing stick) and sometimes a backlight feature</mark>. Specifics like the number of keys or whether a backlight is included can vary by model and region. </p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><div>General Specifications:<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Layout:</strong> QWERTY (standard English layout).</li><li><strong>Switch Type:</strong> Membrane.</li><li><strong>TrackPoint:</strong> A red pointing stick is often included.</li><li><strong>Backlight:</strong> Some models and configurations have a backlit keyboard for use in low-light conditions.</li><li><strong>Material:</strong> Typically made of ABS plastic.</li><li><strong>Number of Keys:</strong> Can vary, but generally around 104 keys.</li><li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> Approximately 12.6 x 4.72 x 0.79 inches (32 x 12 x 2 cm).</li><li><strong>Durability:</strong> Designed to be durable and withstand daily use.</li></ul></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',16,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,7,'lenovo-t440-t440p-t440s-t450-t450s-e431-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,2,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(407,'LAPKEY044','ACER SWIFT A315-54 LAPTOP KEYBOARD',1,2900.0000,5900.0000,0.0000,'e39d88cbf9ddb61844dd7e7d50174735.jpg',87,NULL,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\r\n<div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div>The Acer Swift 3 A315-53 laptop keyboard is a <mark>standard US layout, QWERTY keyboard with a built-in palm rest</mark>. It features a numeric keypad and has the option for backlighting. The keyboard is compatible with various Acer Aspire 3 and Swift 3 models. \r\n<div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;<p>Here\\\'s a more detailed breakdown:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Layout:</strong> Standard US QWERTY layout. \r\n<div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div>\r\n</div></li><li><strong>Numeric Keypad:</strong> Includes a numeric keypad. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Backlighting:</strong> May or may not have backlighting, depending on the specific model configuration. If it does, it can usually be toggled on/off with a function key and a dedicated backlight key. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Compatible with Acer Aspire 3 A315-22, A315-34, A315-42, A315-54, A315-55, A315-56, and Swift 3 SF315-52, SF315-52G series laptops. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Installation:</strong> Designed for easy installation. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Durability:</strong> Constructed with high-quality materials for durability.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',16,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,1,'acer-swift-a315-54-laptop-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,7,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(408,'LAPSPK003','ACER 515-56 SPEAKER',1,4000.0000,6750.0000,0.0000,'3a591ae150de58f0ac6b77e68e031867.jpeg',88,64,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>The Acer Aspire 5 (A515-56 series) generally features built-in stereo speakers for audio output, often described as \\\"integrated\\\" or \\\"two-speaker\\\" setups, providing standard audio for the 15.6-inch Full HD display, with no specific wattage or advanced audio tech usually highlighted in general specs, focusing more on functionality like a headphone jack.</p><p>Key Speaker Characteristics:</p><p>Type: Stereo (two speakers).</p><p>Location: Usually positioned at the bottom front or sides of the laptop chassis.</p><p>Audio Features: Standard audio output, often paired with a headphone/mic combo jack for external audio.</p><p>Sound Quality: Basic, suitable for general use, video calls, and casual media consumption; not \\\"premium\\\" but functional. </p>',NULL,'standard',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,1,'acer-515-56-speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,3,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(409,'LAPSPK004','DELL INSPIRON 3501 SPEAKER',1,3750.0000,5750.0000,0.0000,'d78b573d1ce9fe92100502cb77ba4228.jpeg',88,64,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>The Dell Inspiron 3501 features dual stereo speakers (left and right) with a high-definition audio interface, delivering average 2W and peak 2.5W output, supporting amplifier, and usually paired with Waves MaxxAudio Pro software for enhanced sound, though without a dedicated subwoofer.</p><p>Key Speaker Specifications:</p><p>Number of Speakers: 2 (Left & Right).</p><p>Output: Average 2W, Peak 2.5W.</p><p>Amplifier: Internal speaker amplifier supported.</p><p>Audio Interface: High-definition audio interface.</p><p>Software: Often includes Waves MaxxAudio Pro for audio enhancement.</p><p>Subwoofer: Not supported. </p>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,4,'dell-inspiron-3501-speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,51,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(410,'LAPFAN014','ASUS X542 LAPTOP FAN',1,3000.0000,4900.0000,0.0000,'ec7171998508a6312075ba965c773a2f.jpeg',81,NULL,'','','','','','',1.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The ASUS X542 laptop uses a <mark>cooling fan with a fluid bearing, a 100,000 hour lifespan, and a 2200±10% RPM fan speed</mark>, <a href=\\\"\\\\\\\">according to a product listing on Amazon.com</a>. It has a power consumption of 1.8W and an air volume of 30 CFM. The fan model is EG50060S1-C380-S9A.</p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><p>Here\\\'s a breakdown of the fan specifications: </p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><ul><li><strong>Bearing:</strong> Fluid Bearing</li><li><strong>Fan Life:</strong> 100,000 hours</li><li><strong>Fan Speed:</strong> 2200 ± 10% RPM</li><li><strong>Power:</strong> 1.8W</li><li><strong>Air Volume:</strong> 30 CFM</li><li><strong>Fan Model:</strong> EG50060S1-C380-S9A</li></ul></div></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,3,'asus-x542-laptop-fan',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,6,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(411,'LAPSPK005','ASUS X542 LAPTOP SPEAKER',1,3000.0000,5300.0000,0.0000,'26e4a38e663f52a7d76037b180c42eb6.jpeg',88,64,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>The ASUS X542 laptop features 2.0 Stereo Speakers with ASUS SonicMaster technology, utilizing custom speaker designs and larger chambers (around 19.4cc) for better bass/clarity, alongside AudioWizard software for modes like Music, Movie, and Gaming, aiming for immersive, detailed sound, though specific wattage (often ~1.5W per channel) isn\\\'t always highlighted in general specs but is implied by the tuning.</p><p>Key Audio Features:</p><p>Speaker Design: Round speakers maximize space for better low-frequency performance and reduced noise, with optimized amplifiers.</p><p>SonicMaster Technology: Combines hardware (codec, larger speakers, chambers) and software for precise sound, deeper bass, and noise filtering.</p><p>ASUS AudioWizard: Software for easy tuning with preset modes (Music, Movie, Gaming, Recording, Speech) or manual control.</p><p>Audio Processing: Advanced signal processing refines details and improves clarity for immersive audio.</p><p>Power: Often specified as Stereo 1.5W in detailed reviews, with an impedance of around 4 Ohms. </p>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,3,'asus-x542-laptop-speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,3,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(412,'LAPKEY045','LENOVO G580 LAPTOP KEYBOARD LAPTOP KEYBOARD',1,2500.0000,4000.0000,0.0000,'4987d29ac8d97b5d8657740e11c2fb53.jpg',87,NULL,'','','','','','',1.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><br><p>The Lenovo G580 laptop keyboard is a <mark>standard 6-row, 104-key layout with a US English QWERTY configuration</mark>. It is designed with a classic style and is ambidextrous, meaning it can be used by both left-handed and right-handed users. The keyboard is also designed for long-lasting performance, with quality testing to withstand up to 5 million key presses,</p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><p>Here\\\'s a more detailed breakdown:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Layout:</strong> US English QWERTY \r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></li><li><strong>Number of keys:</strong> 104 <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Hand Orientation:</strong> Ambidextrous <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Key Quality:</strong> Designed for long-lasting performance and tested to withstand up to 5 million key presses. <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Style:</strong> Classic <p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li><strong>Backlight:</strong> The Lenovo G580 does not come standard with a backlit keyboard. If you are looking for a backlit keyboard, you may need to purchase a replacement keyboard that specifically mentions backlighting.</li></ul></div></div>',NULL,'standard',16,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,7,'lenovo-g580-laptop-keyboard-laptop-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,6,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(413,'LPBT071','DELL E7270 E7470 LAPTOP BATTERY J60J5',1,9000.0000,12500.0000,0.0000,'no_image.png',85,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p>\r\n<div><div>\r\n</div><div>The DELL E7270 and E7470 laptop battery with part number J60J5 is a <mark>4-cell, 7.6V, 55Wh Lithium-ion battery</mark>. It\\\'s compatible with both the Dell Latitude E7270 and E7470 laptops. The battery can also be identified by other part numbers like MC34Y, 1W2Y2, 242WD, and GG4FM. \r\n<p>Specifications:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Voltage:</strong> 7.6V</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 55Wh</li><li><strong>Cells:</strong> 4-cell</li><li>