Specific details about the keyboards:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Backlight Functionality:</strong> The backlight illuminates the keys, making them easier to see in low-light conditions. \r\n<div>\r\n</div></li><li><strong>Brightness Control:</strong> Users can usually adjust the backlight brightness using the Fn + Spacebar or Fn + Esc keys. </li><li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> The keyboards are designed to be compatible with the respective Thinkpad models (X280, X390, X13, L13) and may also be compatible with variants like the X395 and L13 Yoga. </li><li><strong>US Layout:</strong> Many of these keyboards are designed with a standard US English layout. </li><li><strong>Part Numbers:</strong> Specific part numbers like 01YP160 and 01YP040 are mentioned in relation to these backlit keyboards. </li><li><strong>Replacement:</strong> Replacement keyboards are available for these models, including those with backlights. </li><li><strong>Installation:</strong> The keyboards are designed for easy installation as replacements. </li><li><strong>Durability:</strong> The keyboards are generally built to withstand daily wear and tear.</li></ul></div></div></div>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,7,'lenovo-thinkpad-x280-x390-x13-l13-laptop-keyboard-with-',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,0,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(416,'LPBG011','DELL LAPTOP BACKPACK',1,1600.0000,3000.0000,0.0000,'71c3e0ea986537f9a940035ff168f629.jpeg',82,NULL,'','','','','','',15.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','',NULL,'standard',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,4,'dell-laptop-backpack',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,17,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(417,'LAP043','ASUS VIVOBOOK A1502V I7 13620H | 16GB | 1TB | 15.6INCH | DOS LAPTOP',1,208000.0000,235000.0000,0.0000,'e0e480031e9946889e18038e424bf119.png',90,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>01 YEAR