icroSD card reader. \r\n<p>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</p></li><li>The laptop typically comes with a docking connector for expanded connectivity.</li></ul></div>',NULL,'standard',19,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,7,'used-lenovo-thinkpad-x13-i5-10310u-16gb-256gb-nvme-14in',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,4,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(421,'ULAP037','USED LENOVO T14 RYZEN 5 PRO 4650U | 16GB | 512GB | 14INCH | AMD GRAPHIC | 180 DEGREE LAPTOP',1,71500.0000,105000.0000,0.0000,'1d817ab62f21d42e1f5504f533f05ec0.jpeg',89,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRAANTY</p><p>The Lenovo ThinkPad T14 with the Ryzen 5 PRO 4650U processor, 16GB of RAM, and a 512GB SSD, features a <mark>14-inch display and integrated AMD graphics</mark>. It also includes a 180-degree hinge design, allowing the screen to lay flat.</p><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;<p>Key Specifications:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 PRO 4650U</li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16GB RAM</li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512GB SSD</li><li><strong>Display:</strong> 14-inch, likely FHD (1920x1080) resolution</li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated AMD Radeon Graphics</li><li><strong>Operating System:</strong> Windows 10 Pro (downgraded from Windows 11 Pro)</li><li><strong>Other Features:</strong> 180-degree hinge, backlit keyboard, various ports including USB-C and HDMI</li></ul></div></div>',NULL,'standard',19,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,95000.0000,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,7,'used-lenovo-t14-ryzen-5-pro-4650u-16gb-512gb-14inch-amd',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,104,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(422,'ULAP038','USED LENOVO X1 YOGA I5 8350U | 8GB | 256GB | 14INCH | BACKLIGHT | TOUCH | 360 ROTATE | TOUCH PEN | W11 LAPTOP',1,63000.0000,98000.0000,0.0000,'a5c578ad466718aa61e428b26f7e60f0.jpeg',89,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</