HS WARRANTY</p><p>The HP ProBook 430 G3, 440 G3, 445 G3, 430 G5, 440 G5, and 445 G5 laptop keyboards share some key specifications and compatibility details. They all generally feature a standard US English layout, and some models are available with or without backlighting. The G5 models (430 G5, 440 G5, 445 G5) are <mark>compatible with keyboards using part number L01071-001, and some may have a backlit feature with a frame</mark>. The G3 models (430 G3, 440 G3, 445 G3) may also be compatible with certain keyboards designed for the 640 G2 and 645 G2 models, especially those with a Russian or Spanish layout. </p>\r\n<div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div><p>Key Specifications and Features:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<div><div><div><strong>Layout:</strong><p>US English is a common layout, but other layouts (like Russian or Spanish) may also be available. </p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li>\r\n<p><strong>Backlighting:</strong>\r\n</p><p>Some models and replacement keyboards offer backlighting for use in low-light conditions. </p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div>\r\n</div></div></div></li><li>\r\n<p><strong>Frame:</strong>\r\n</p><p>Some keyboards for the G5 models come with a frame, which can be important for proper fit and installation. </p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div>\r\n</div></div></div></li><li>\r\n<p><strong>Compatibility:</strong>\r\n</p><p>The G5 models (430 G5, 440 G5, 445 G5) are often compatible with the same replacement keyboards. </p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div>\r\n</div></div></div></li><li>\r\n<p><strong>Pointstick:</strong>\r\n</p><p>Some G3 models (430 G3, 440 G3, 445 G3) may include a Pointstick for cursor control. </p><div><div><div><div>&lt;svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;</div>\r\n</div></div></div></li><li>\r\n<p><strong>Part Numbers:</strong>\r\n</p><p>The L01071-001 is a part number associated with replacement keyboards for the HP ProBoo