stance. It is designed for comfortable typing and includes features like a touchpad with palm rejection.</p><p>Here\\\'s a more detailed breakdown:</p><p>Chiclet Design:</p><p>The keyboard uses a chiclet-style key layout, which typically features individual, square-shaped keys with rounded edges, offering a comfortable typing experience. </p><p>Key Travel:</p><p>The 1.8mm key travel refers to the distance the keycap travels when pressed, impacting the overall feel and responsiveness of the keyboard. </p><p>Palm Rejection:</p><p>The touchpad includes palm rejection technology, which helps prevent accidental cursor movements caused by your palm resting on the touchpad while typing. </p><p>Compatibility:</p><p>The ASUS X556U keyboard is compatible with various ASUS X556 models, including the X556UA, X556UB, X556UF, X556UJ, X556UQ, and X556UR. </p><p>Replacement:</p><p>Replacement keyboards are available for the ASUS X556U, ensuring users can easily replace a damaged or worn-out keyboard. </p>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,3,'asus-x556u-laptop-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,7,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(452,'LAPDIS017','14INCH 30PIN SLIM IPS FHD DISPLAY ',1,20500.0000,25500.0000,0.0000,'dd5fda2013a131189bb17e081c492bbe.jpeg',86,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'14inch-30pin-slim-ips-fhd-display',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,5,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(453,'LAPSPK007','ACER E5-575  E5-573 LAPTOP SPEAKER',1,3000.0000,5500.0000,0.0000,'ddfa45771eee57ea95a18f4aa1e419e7.jpg',88,64,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>Dell Latitude E5480 and E5490 laptops use integrated stereo speakers, typically a left and right pair, connected via a 4-pin connector, designed as replacements for standard business lap