EYBOARD',1,4750.0000,7750.0000,0.0000,'no_image.png',87,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p>',NULL,'standard',16,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,5,'hp-probook-450-g6-laptop-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,57,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(548,'LAPKEY062','ASUS VIVOBOOK 15 X1504 LAPTOP KEYBOARD',1,4000.0000,6500.0000,0.0000,'8099cf3d5b3fae263aed2d8ec77cf399.jpeg',88,87,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>Asus Vivobook 15 (X1504)Review: Solid but Unspectacular ...The ASUS Vivobook 15 X1504 features an ErgoSense Chiclet Keyboard with 1.4mm key travel, offering a satisfying tactile bump and optimal bounce for comfortable typing, including an enhanced number pad with calculator hotkeys and full-size key pitch; while most models include backlighting, check specific configurations as some base models might omit it. </p><p>Key Specifications:</p><p>Keyboard Type: ErgoSense Chiclet Keyboard.</p><p>Key Travel: 1.4mm.</p><p>Feel: Designed for optimal key bounce and tactile feedback.</p><p>Keycap Design: Features 0.1mm keycap relief, keeping keys slightly above the chassis when fully depressed.</p><p>Number Pad: Enhanced layout with calculator (CE, +/-) hotkeys and better spacing for intuitive data entry.</p><p>Backlighting: Generally Backlit, but some variants (like the X1504VA) may not have it.</p><p>Touchpad: Precision Touchpad. </p>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,3,'asus-vivobook-15-x1504-laptop-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,92,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(549,'OTH011','LAPTOP STICKER',1,0.0000,950.0000,0.0000,'97513c20de34be830f83b701b35d615b.jpg',88,56,'','','','','','',13.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','',NULL,'standard',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,'laptop-sticker',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,54,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(551,'ULAP069','USED LENOVO THIKPAD T460 I5 6TH 6300U | 8GB | 256GB | 14INCH | W11 LAPTOP',1,0.0000,59000.0000,0.0000,'6ffb971fb43eac0113814345ce790482.jpeg',89,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>03 MONTHS WARRANTY</p>',NULL,'standard',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,7,'used-lenovo-thikpad-t460-i5-6th-6300u-8gb-256gb-14inch-',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,18,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(552,'LAPSPK009','ASUS ROG G531/G731 SPEAKER',1,3500.0000,4500.0000,0.0000,'e91aa07a7d0c290807331d7fa2e426c2.jpg',88,64,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>The ASUS ROG G531/G731 series uses stereo, built-in laptop speakers that come in different connector versions (4-pin and 6-pin), often with an 8Ω impedance for better sound and motherboard protection, offering immersive audio for gaming, with specific models like G531GT, G731GV, etc., compatible with these replacement parts.</p><p>Key Specifications & Features:</p><p>Type: Stereo Laptop Built-In Speakers (Left & Right Pair).</p><p>Compatibility: Fits various ROG Strix G series models (G531, G731, GL531, G512, G712, etc.).</p><p>Connector: Available in both 4-pin and 6-pin versions; checking your original speaker connector is crucial before buying a replacement.</p><p>Impedance: Original speakers are often 8Ω (Ohms), providing better sound quality and motherboard safety compared to lower impedance replacements.</p><p>Sound: Designed for high-quality, immersive sound for gaming and multimedia.</p><p>Construction: Durable, using quality materials for long-lasting use. </p>',NULL,'standard',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,3,'asus-rog-g531g731-speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,53,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(553,'LAPFAN015','ASUS ROG STRIX G512 CI CPU & GPU LAPTOP COOLING FAN',1,0.0000,15000.00