ec, focusing more on its integrated stereo design and sound quality tech.</p><p>Key Specs & Features:</p><p>Type: Built-in Stereo Speakers.</p><p>Audio Tech: Often includes ASUS SonicMaster for improved audio.</p><p>Output: Standard multimedia audio (replacement parts sometimes list 5W max).</p><p>Connectivity: Internal (wired within the laptop).</p><p>Design: Integrated into the laptop chassis, part of the X555L series (X555M, F555LD, A555L, etc.). </p>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,3,'asus-x555l-speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,70,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(644,'ULAP090','USED DELL LATITUDE 5400 I5 8265U | 16GB | 512GB | 14INCH | BACKLIGHT | 180 DEGREE LAPTOP',1,53000.0000,76000.0000,0.0000,'84b2a2b483d4aa15785253620d9f06ca.jpeg',89,NULL,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p>',NULL,'standard',19,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,4,'used-dell-latitude-5400-i5-8265u-16gb-512gb-14inch-back',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,72,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(645,'LAP104','MSI THIN 15 B13VE I5 13420H | 16GB | 512GB | RTX4050 6GB | 15.6INCH | BACKLIT | WIN11 | COSMOS GRAY LAPTOP',1,235000.0000,268000.0000,0.0000,'7f68ecfd9f53af1e8a9d09eeac6ea49d.png',90,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>01 YEAR WARRANTY</p><p>ProcessorIntel Core i5-13420H (8 cores: 4 P-cores + 4 E-cores, up to 4.6 GHz)</p><p>GraphicsNVIDIA GeForce RTX 4050 Laptop GPU with 6GB GDDR6 VRAM</p><p>Display15.6\\\" Full HD (1920x1080), 144Hz refresh rate, IPS-level panel</p><p>Memory (RAM)16GB DDR4-3200 (2 slots, upgradable to a max of 64GB)</p><p>Storage512GB NVMe PCIe Gen 4 SSD</p><p>Operating SystemWindows 11 Home</p><p>ColorCosmos Gray</p>',NULL,'standard',19,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,258000.0000,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,8,'msi-thin-15-b13ve-i5-13420h-16gb-512gb-rtx4