tant laptop keyboard.</p><p>Key Mechanism: Scissor-switch, offering responsive, soft-touch feedback.</p><p>Layout: QWERTY (US English standard, but regional variations exist).</p><p>Backlight: Available in some configurations (single-color, usually white/blue).</p><p>TrackPoint: Yes, features the classic red TrackPoint.</p><p>Color: Black.</p><p>Frame: Often sold with a black frame.</p><p>Part Numbers (Examples): 00PA452, 00PA534, SN20H42323, SN20H42405.</p><p>Compatibility: Works with ThinkPad T460, T460s, T470, T470s models. </p>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,7,'lenovo-thinkpad-t460-laptop-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,80,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(648,'LAPKEY071','MSI KATANA G66 LAPTOP KEYBOARD',1,8500.0000,12000.0000,0.0000,'b1cb3164d1d339ca6c381ce18bd84c6b.jpeg',88,87,'','','','','','',1.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>Backlighting: Single-Color (Red).</p><p>Key Type: Gaming Keyboard with distinct tactile feedback and clear pressure points.</p><p>Key Travel: 1.7mm.</p><p>Layout: Full-size with a number pad.</p><p>Customization: Adjustable brightness (3 levels) via function keys, with option to turn off.</p>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,8,'msi-katana-g66-laptop-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,73,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(649,'LAPKEY072','LENOVO 320-15 LAPTOP KEYBOARD ',1,3000.0000,6500.0000,0.0000,'7076fb850771f5df0fd9e5cf99cf1fa6.jpeg',88,87,'','','','','','',2.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The Lenovo 320-15 laptop keyboard is typically a full-size, QWERTY layout, often available in black, with variations for different models (320-15ABR, IAP, AST, IK, ISK) and potentially featuring backlighting, though some models come without it, using a standard ribbon cable connection for replacement. Key specs include ~104 keys (US layout), standard function keys (volume, brightness), and robust build for daily use, with compatibility depending on your specific 320-15 variant. </p><p>Key Specifications & Features:</p><p>Layout: QWERTY (US standard most common).</p><p>Keys: Around 104 keys, including numeric keypad.</p><p>Color: Usually Black.</p><p>Backlight: Available as an option, but not on all models.</p><p>Connection: Wired via a ribbon cable.</p><p>Compatibility: Specific to sub-models (e.g., 320-15IKB, 320-15AST, 320-15IAP).</p>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,7,'lenovo-320-15-laptop-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,80,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(650,'LAPFAN018','HP 15-DU LAPTOP FAN',1,6000.0000,6000.0000,0.0000,'81aeb77a67d7b6d39c793003929605a8.jpg',88,81,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','',NULL,'standard',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,5,'hp-15-du-laptop-fan',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,66,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(651,'ULAP091','USED LENOVO THINKPAD E14 I5 10210U | 8GB | 256GB | BACKLIT | 14INCH LAPTOP',1,94000.0000,94000.0000,0.0000,'d5bbe9b704d0663fbf62af26629557db.jpg',89,NULL,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p>',NULL,'standard',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,7,'used-lenovo-thinkpad-e14-i5-10210u-8gb-256gb-backlit-14',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,104,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(653,'ULAP093','HP ELITEBOOK 735 G5 RYZEN 3 PRO 2300U | 8GB | 256GB | 14INCH | W11 LAPTOP',1,55000.0000,80000.0000,0.0000,'14c28e12d9b3c6faa0b0bacb9e12364c.jpg',89,NULL,'','','','','','',NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','',NULL,'standard',586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,65000.0000,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,5,'hp-elitebook-735-g5-ryzen-3-pro-2300u-8gb-256gb-14inch-',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NUL