Details:</p><p>Type: Left (L) & Right (R) CPU & GPU Cooling Fans.</p><p>Voltage: DC 12V (Important: Must match original; not compatible with DC5V).</p><p>Connector: 4-Pin.</p><p>Cooling Method: Air.</p><p>Wattage: Around 12 Watts (typical for these replacement sets).</p><p>Compatibility: For ASUS ROG Strix G512L, G512LW, G512LU, G512LI, G512LWS, G512LV models.</p><p>What\\\'s Included (Often): A set of both fans plus thermal grease. </p>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,3,'asus-rog-g512-lr-gpu8-cpu-cooling-fan',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,79,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(677,'LAPKEY074','DELL LATITUDE 3400 LAPTOP KEYBOARD',1,4750.0000,8500.0000,0.0000,'8f7c058ffd1b42da12eac00076f955b5.jpg',88,87,'','','','','','',1.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The Dell Latitude 3400 keyboard is a full-sized, single-pointing keyboard, available as either non-backlit or with optional backlighting, featuring QWERTY/AZERTY/Kanji layouts, 19mm key pitch, and specific regional key counts (e.g., 103/104 keys) with adjustable timeout settings for the backlight in the BIOS. </p><p>Key Specifications:</p><p>Type: Full-sized, Single Pointing.</p><p>Layouts: QWERTY, AZERTY, Kanji (regional variations).</p><p>Keys: Around 103-107 keys depending on region (e.g., 103 for US/Canada, 104 for Europe).</p><p>Key Pitch: 19.00 mm (X & Y).</p><p>Backlighting: Optional (non-backlit standard, backlit available).</p><p>Function Keys: Includes multimedia shortcuts (Fn+F5 for Play/Pause, etc.) and display switching (Fn+F8).</p>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,4,'dell-latitude-3400-laptop-keyboard',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,67,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(678,'LAPFAN020','ASUS X513 LAPTOP FAN',1,5000.0000,12500.0000,0.0000,'e58761f264f652f2dc2d6067ac86cf38.jpg',88,81,'','','','','','',2.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128