0x4 NVMe® SSD (supports up to two M.2 SSDs)</p><p>Display15.6-inch Full HD (1920x1080) IPS, 144Hz refresh rate, 300 nits brightness, 100% sRGB, Anti-glare, NVIDIA G-SYNC®</p><p>Operating SystemWindows 11 Home</p><p>AudioStereo speakers, 2W x2, optimized with Nahimic Audio</p><p>CameraHD 720p with E-shutter and dual microphone array</p><p>Ports* 1x USB-C® 3.2 Gen 2 (supports DisplayPort™ 1.4, 140W Power Delivery)</p>',NULL,'standard',19,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,256000.0000,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,7,'lenovo-loq-15arp9-ryzen-5-7235hs-12gb-512gb-rtx4050-6gb-156inch-laptop1',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,31,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(681,'LPBT032','LENOVO THINKPAD 370 01AV434/01AV433/00HW027 LAPTOP BATTERY',1,9750.0000,14000.0000,0.0000,'no_image.png',88,85,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The Lenovo ThinkPad 370 battery with part numbers like 01AV434, 01AV433, and 00HW027 is a 15.2V Li-ion battery, typically around 44Wh or 51Wh capacity, designed for models like the ThinkPad Yoga 370, 260, and X380, featuring 4 cells for reliable power with built-in safety protections against overcharging and overheating. </p><p>Key Specifications:</p><p>Battery Type: Lithium-Ion (Li-ion)</p><p>Voltage: 15.2V (or 15.28V/15.285V)</p><p>Capacity: Varies slightly, often 2895mAh (44Wh) or 3.34Ah (51Wh)</p><p>Cells: 4 Cells</p><p>Compatibility: Lenovo ThinkPad Yoga 370, 260, X260, X380</p><p>Replaces Part Numbers: 01AV432, 01AV434, 00HW026, SB10K97589, SB10K97590, SB10K97591, 4ICP5/53/88 </p>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,7,'lenovo-thinkpad-370-01av43401av43300hw027-laptop-batter',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,32,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(682,'LAPSPK015','ASUS X509 SPEAKER',1,4000.0000,7000.0000,0.0000,'no_image.png',88,64,'','','','','','',0.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>The ASUS X509 speakers are internal, bottom-firing stereo speakers designed for general use, offering decent sound with some bass but not audiophile quality, featuring a 4-pin connector, 16 Ohms impedance, and designed for models like the X509JB, X509FA, etc., primarily for basic media consumption rather than immersive gaming.</p><p>Speaker Specifications</p><p>Type: Internal Stereo Speakers (Left & Right)</p><p>Configuration: 2.0 Stereo</p><p>Connector: 4-pin, 4-wire</p><p>Impedance: 16 Ohms</p><p>Placement: Bottom-firing (located on the underside of the laptop)</p><p>Wattage/Power: Around 2V (Voltage specified on some replacement parts)</p><p>Compatibility: Fits ASUS X509 series (X509JB, X509FA, X509MA, X509DA, etc.) </p>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,3,'asus-x509-speaker',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0000,NULL,66,0,'',0,0,'0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(683,'LAPKEY077','DELL LATITUDE E5540 LAPTOP KEYBOARD',1,5500.0000,9800.0000,0.0000,'d92d2ae315464276da0401b339aad5b8.jpg',88,87,'','','','','','',1.0000,NULL,1,'',NULL,'code128','','<p>06 MONTHS WARRANTY</p><p>The Dell Latitude E5540 keyboard typically features a QWERTY layout, often with a numeric keypad, available in various language localizations (US, UK, French, etc.), and comes in both backlit and non-backlit versions, often identified by part numbers like 4RNXY or 76X2J, with some variations including a pointing stick (Track Pointer). Key specs include standard key pitch, Fn key shortcuts, and compatibility with different screen resolutions (HD/FHD). </p><p>Key Specifications</p><p>Layout: QWERTY (US, UK, French, etc.)</p><p>Numpad: Yes, typically included</p><p>Backlit: Available in both backlit and non-backlit models</p><p>Pointing Stick: Some versions include a Track Pointer (Trackpoint)</p><p>Part Numbers (Examples): 4RNXY, 04RNXY, ND8V6, 76X2J, 09R8FR</p><p>Keys: Around 99-104 keys depending on layout/features</p>',NULL,'standard',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N